<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Matthew</book>
  <para style="h">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="mt">Matthew</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham’ ta David, David’ suon Messiah Jesu’ khang ciemtena tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham’ ta Isaac, Isaac’ ta Jacob; Jacob’ ta Judah le a sanggam pasalte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a zi Tamar tawh a nei Judah’ ta Perez le Zerah, Perez’ ta Hezron, Hezron’ ta Aram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aram’ ta Aminadab, Aminadab’ ta Nahshon, Nahshon’ ta Salmon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a zi Rahab tawh a nei Salmon’ ta Boaz, a zi Ruth tawh a nei Boaz’ ta Obed, Obed’ ta Jessi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />le Jessi’ ta Kumpi David ahi hi. Uriah’ zi Bathsheba tawh a nei David’ ta Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon’ ta Rehoboam, Rehoboam’ ta Abijah, Abijah’ ta Asaph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asaph’ ta Jehoshaphat, Jehoshaphat’ ta Joram, Joram’ ta Uzziah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzziah’ ta Jotham, Jotham’ ta Ahaz, Ahaz’ ta Hezekiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah’ ta Manasseh, Manasseh’ ta Amos, Amos’ ta Josiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Josiah’ ta Jechoniah le a sanggamte ahi a, Babylon ah sala a kipeipi hun pawla suoh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babylon ah sala a kipeipi zaw ciengin: Jechoniah’ ta Salathiel, Salathiel’ ta Zerubbabel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerubbabel’ ta Abiud, Abiud’ ta Eliakim, Eliakim’ ta Azor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azor’ ta Zadok, Zadok’ ta Achim, Achim’ ta Eliud,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliud’ ta Eleazar, Eleazer’ ta Matthan, Matthan’ ta Jacob,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jacob’ ta pen Mary’ pasal Joseph ahi a, tua Mary panin Messiah a kici Jesu a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abraham pan David dong khang sawm le khang li hi a, David panin Babylon-a saltan dong khang sawm le khang li ma pha a, Babylon pan sala a kipeipi-a kipan Messiah suo hun cieng dong khang sawm le khang li ma a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Messiah Jesu Khris ang suo dan tam bang ahi hi. A nu Mary pen Joseph tawh a kikham laitah ahi a, hinanle a lupton masangun Hlagau Siengtho in Mary a gaisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pasal Joseph pen mi thuman khat ahi ziehin mipi lahah ama daisah nuom loin khuldap ding a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle tam banga bawl dingin a ngaisut laitahin, ama kungah Topa’ vantungmi khat kihil a, “David’ tapa Joseph aw, Mary na zi dingin la ngam la sin, azieh pen ama sunga a gai nau pen Hlagau Siengtho in a gaisah ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in tapa khat nei ding a, tuapa in ama’ mite a mawna panun hunkhie ding ahi ziehin a min Jesu na phuo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in kamsangpa tungtawnin a gensa thute a tangtun nadingin tam thute a pieng ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />En un! Ngahnu khat gai-in tapa khat nei ding a, ama’ min dingin Emmanuel a phuoh ding uhi. A khietna in, “Eite tawh Pasien omton” cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kimutna panin Joseph a khahlaw ciengin Topa in ama a sawl bangin bawl pai a, tua nu a zi dingin a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua tapa a suo masangsie tua nu a luppi sih a, tuale ama in a min Jesu a vaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Herod hun sungin Judea gam Bethlehem khuo ah Jesu a suo zaw ciengin nisuona lam panin Jerusalem ah mipilte a tung vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jew mite kumpi ding ahi ang suoh nausen hei-a om ahei” ci-in dong uhi. Azieh pen ama’ aasi ang suoh ka mu zo ta vua, ama zatahna pie dinga ang pei ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Herod in tam thu a zah ciengin ama le Jerusalem-a mi zosie a zau mama uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale siempu liente le thukham hil sie zosie kaikhawm a, ama in Messiah suo nading mun amate dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in, “Judea gam Bethlehem ah a suoh ding hi; azieh pen kamsang pa in hici bangin na giel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Judea gama om nang Bethlehem khuo aw, Judah gam-uhte lahah a neu pen na hi vawt sih hi; bangzieh ahei cile ka mi Israel-te a cing dingin nang sung panin uhpa khat pieng ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Herod in mipilte hlandapin amate tung panin aasi a kilah hun cientahin dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Bethlehem ah amate sawl a, “Pei unlen tua nausen limtahin hing sui un; ama na mu ciengun kei zong pei-in ama zatahna ka pieh thei nadingin thu ei zasahkia un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in kumpipa thu vaihlah a zah zaw ciengun vai a ding uhi; tuale amate in a mu ngaisa uh ang suoh aasi, nausen opna tung sontahah a khawl masang, khumtah amau’ mai-ah na peipei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua aasi a khawl a mu ciengun a lungdam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inn sungah amate lut a, a nu Mary le nausen a mu uhi; tuale amate in khupdinin ama zatahna a pie uhi. Tua ciengin a gou bawmte uh a suo vua, kham, panamtui, le myrrh panamtuite letsongin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Herod kunga a kilekia lo nadingun a mang sung vuah a kihilkhol ziehin lam tuom zui-in a gam vuah a kilekia ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate a pei zaw ciengun Joseph’ mang sungah Topa’ vantungmi khat kihil a, “Tho inlen nausen le a nu, Egypt gamah taipi inlen, kang genkia masangsie tuanah va om ta’n; azieh pen Herod in tua nausen tha dingin a sui hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph tho pai a, khum zan ma-in nausen le a nu zawpi-in Egypt gamah a tai vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Herod a si masangsie khum sungah a om uhi. Tam thu pen kamsangte tungtawnin Topa in a na gensa, “Egypt panin ka tapa ka hlan ta hi,” a ci thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipilte in a sol lamtah Herod in a thei ciengin lungthah mama a, tuale ama in zong mi sawlin aasi lam mipilte tung pana a theisa hun tawh kituohin Bethlehem khuo le a kimvela om kum ni le a neisie nausen zosie a thatsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsangpa Jeremiah’ genkholna:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Rama khuo ah nahpi tah kaana le mauna kiza a, Rachel in a tate kaa a, a tate a op tah lo ziehin koima in ama hlai zo lo hi,” a ci thu a tangtunna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod a si zaw ciengin Egypt gama om Joseph kungah Topa’ vantungmi khat a mang sungah kihil a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Nausen tha dinga a suite si zo ahi ziehin tho-in nausen le a nu zawpi inlen Israel gamah pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph tho-in nausen le a nu zawpi a, Israel gamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Archelaus in a pa Herod tangin Judea gam a uh lam a zah bepin tua munah a pei ngam ta sih hi. Tuale a mang sunga a kihil zaw ciengin ama Galilee gamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nazareth a kici khuo khatah tengin, “Ama Nazareth khuomi kici ding hi,” ci-a kamsangte’ genna a tangtun thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Judea gamlah ah Baptize-pa John kilahin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kisiakia un, azieh pen vantung gam ang tung kuon ta hi,” ci-in a tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kamsang Isaiah in, “Gamlahah a kiko pa’ aw in: ‘ Topa pei nading lampi siel unlen, a lampi na tangsah un,’ ci hi,” ci-in a na gen lai-in tampa thu gen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in John in kala-oh mul kigan puon silin savun tawh a kawng gah a, a an pen khuombai le gamkhuoizu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah Jerusalem, Judea gam sung zosie le Jordan kuol sunga om mi zosie pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a mawnate uh pulahin ama in Jordan gunah amate a baptize hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in Pharisee-te le Sadducees-te a tampi khat a ki-baptize dinga ang pei a mu ciengin amate kungah, “No muoltan suonte! Ang tung ding thangpaina pan na tai nadingun koi in ang hil ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kisiakiana tawh a kilawm ga na ga un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Abraham pen ka pupi uh hi lel,’ ci-in mawh ngaisut sih un; azieh pen ken kang cina ah, Pasien in tami suongte panin Abraham’ suonlehlahte piengsah thei lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu nangawnin zong singzung cin tengah hei kikoi zo hi; a, ga hoi a ga lo singkung vannuoi kiphua-in mei sungah kipai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kisiakia nadingin tui sungah note kang baptize a, hizongle ka nua-a ang pei ding pa pen kei sanga a vanglienzaw ahi hi; ama’ kedap tawi dingin zong ka kilawm sih hi. Ama in Hlagau Siengtho le mei tawh note ang baptize ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a khut sungah lawpi tawi-in a buphuol zap sieng ding a, a tah teng bem sungah khol ding hi; a si teng pen a mit ngai lo meikuong sungah haltum ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin John a ki-baptize sah dingin Galilee panin Jordan gunah Jesu a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />John in, “Nang in kei nei baptize ding hizaw bo a, bang dinga kei kunga hing pei zawsop na hei?” ci-in a na kham sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in, “Tu-in ei mang phot in; azieh pen thudih zosie i tangtunsah ding a kilawm ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi. Tua bepin ama a thukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu a ki-baptize zaw tui sung panin a pusuoto lien tahin thakhatin van kihong a, vakhu bangin Pasien’ Hlagau kumsuhin ama tungah tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale vantung panin awging khat in, “Tam pa pen kei ei lungkimsah ka it mama ka tapa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin dawimangpa’ ze-etna thuoh dingin Hlagau in gamlahah Jesu a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sun sawmli le zan sawmli an a tan zaw ciengin a gilkiel mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama kungah a ze-et ding pa pei-in, “Pasien’ Tapa na hi leh tami suongte thupie inlen khomun suohsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in dawng a, ‘Mihingte an beh tawh hing ahi sih a, Pasien’ kam pana a pusuoh thu zosie tawh a hing ahi zaw hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin dawimangpa in muol siengtho tungah ama peipi-in biehinnpi khumvum ah koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama kungah, “Pasien’ Tapa na hi leh nang le nang kumsuh in; azieh pen ‘Ama in nang adingin a vantung mite thupie ding a, ‘Na keng in suong a siakhah lo nadingin a khut utawh ang dom ding uhi,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Na Topa Pasien na ze-et sin,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dawimangpa in muolsang mama khat tungah ama peipi leuleu a, leitung kumpi gam teng le a thupina zosie lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Khupbawhin kei nei bieh leh tam teng zosie nangma kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Satan aw, kihemkhie in! Azieh pen Topa na Pasien bie inlen, ama’ na beh sem in,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin dawimangpa in ama a peisan a, tuale thakhatin vantung mite pei-in ama an a vah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in John a kimat zo lam Jesu in a zah ciengin Galilee gamah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Nazareth nuasie-in tuipi gei-a om Capernaum khuo ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khu kamsang Isaiah’ thugen a tangtun nading ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Zebulun le Napthali gam, tuipi gei-a lampi, Jordan gungal, Gentile-te opna Galilee gam sung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khuomiel sunga om mite in khuovah lienpi a mu zo vua, sina hlim sunga om mite tungah khuovah ang tang ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum huna kipan Jesu thuhil kipan a, “Vantung gam ang tung kuon ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Galilee Tuipi gei-ah Jesu a pei laitahin ama in unau pasal ni, Peter a kici Simon le a sanggampa Andrew-te tuipi-ah lenpai-a om a mu hi, azieh pen amate ngabeng ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale amate kungah, “Keima ei zui un, mi mante kang suohsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in thakhatin a lente uh nuasie-in ama a zui pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum mun pan a pei zaw ciengin unau adang pasal ni, Zebedee’ tapa James le John-te unau, a pa uh Zebedee tawh gunkuong tungah len phaw-a om mu a, ama gel zong a hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama gel in zong thakhatin gunkuong le a pa uh nuasie-in ama a zui pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Galilee gam sung tengah Jesu vah kawikawi a, amau’ kikhopna inn ah thuhilin Pasien’ manggam lungdamna thu tangko a, mipi lahah cina luna zosie a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n Syria gam sung zosie-ah a minthanna kizel a, mi cina zosie, natna le dammawna tuomtuom a thuohte, dawi’ matte, a sibupte, khut le keng zawte, ama kungah a peipi vua, ama in tuate a damsah sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galilee gam, Decapolis gam le Jerusalem khuopi-a kipan Judea gam, Jordan gungal khat panin mihonpi in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in mihonpite a mu ciengin ama muol tungah a kato hi; tuale a to zaw ciengin ama kungah a nuazuite a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate thuhil dingin kipan a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hlagau lamah a zawngkhal mite thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile vantung gam amau-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A kap a maute thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate a kihenem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Lungnem mite thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in leitung luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Dihna zieha gilkiel dangtate thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate a lungtai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hepi theite thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in hepina nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungsim siengthote thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in Pasien a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kilemna bawlte thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate Pasien’ tate kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dihna zieha bawlsietna a thuoh mite thupha nga ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile vantung gam amau-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima ziehin mite in hing hosie-in ang bawlsiet vua, a man lopi-a sietna namcin tawh ang mawsah uh ciengin thupha nga na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vantungah na thaman uh lien ahi ziehin lungdamin kipah un. Azieh pen no masanga kamsangte zong tua ma bangin na kibawlsie ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Note leitung ci na hi uhi; hinanle ci a alna mang leh bangci ki-alsahkia ding ahei? Paimangin keng tawh totcil ding longal a kimanna ding a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Note leitung khuovah na hi uhi. Muol tunga kilam khuo kisel thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Meivah a vah zaw ciengin koima in law khu loin meivah tunna tungah koizaw a, tua in inn sung zosie tanvah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ma bangin amate in na silpha bawl uh a mu ciengun vantunga om na Pa uh’ min a phat thei nadingun mite mai-ah na khuovah uh na tangsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thukham ahi sihle kamsangte’ thuhilna a phietmang dinga ang pei-in ei ngaisun sih un; a phietmang dinga ang pei ka hi sih a, a kicingsah dinga ang pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen a tahtah a kang ci-in, van le lei a mangthai zongin na zosie a tangtun masangsie thukham laimal cindawncie zong mangthai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tami thukhamte lah panin a neupen khat zong palsatin khum bangma-a bawl dinga midangte a hil poma vantung gam sungah a neupen kici ding hi; ahi vangin tami thukhamte zui-in, a zui nading vua thu a hil poma vantung gam sungah milien kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ke’n kang ci-in, note’ dihna in Pharisee-te le thukham hil siete’ dihna a khup zawh sih leh vantung gam sungah na lut thei poma sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tanglai mite kungah, ‘Tuol na that sih ding uhi; tuol that poma thukhenna thuoh ding hi,’ a kici thu na zahsa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, na sanggampa ahi sihle na sanggamnu tunga na lungthah uleh thukhenna na thuoh ding uhi; tuale note in na sanggampa ahi sihle na sanggamnu na hosiet uleh upate’ thukhenna zumah thusitna na thuoh ding uhi; tuale note in, ‘Nang mimaw pa’ na ci uleh hell meili sungah thukhenna na thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin maitam ah biehna na pieh laitahin nang tungah na sanggampa ahi sihle na sanggamnu khat a lungkim lo lam na phaw khah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tua maitam mai-ah na biehna nuasie phot inlen pei-in; na sanggampa ahi sihle na sanggamnu tawh va kilem masa phot ta’n, tua zaw ciengin hing pei-in na biehna piekia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na langpa tawh thukhenna zumah a kikhie dinga lampi-ah na zawton laitahin ama tawh kilem nading bawl pai in, tua ahi sihle na langpa in thukhente tungah hing ap ding a, thukhente in mimante tungah hing pie-in thong sungah ang khum theikha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, lieusum na khieh zo masangsie na suohta ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ ‘Ang na kawm sih ding hi,’ a kici thu na zahsa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hizongle ke’n kang ci-in, lunggulna tawh numei khat a en mi zosie a lungsimin angkawm zo ahi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na zietlam mit in ang mawsah leh kheidawh inlen paimang in; na pumpi buppi hell khuh sunga ang kipai sangin na tahsa behkhat a pelem ding nang adingin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na zietlam khut in ang mawsah leh sattan inlen paimang in; na pumpi buppi hell khuh sunga a pei sangin na tahsa behkhat a pelem ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘A zi a khul poma in khulna lai pie taheh,’ zong kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, khielna khat zieh simlo a zi khul poma in ama nu pen angkawmsah a suoh hi; a kikhulsa numei a kinunpi poma zong angkawm a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tanglai mite kungah, ‘Zuouthu tawh kiciem loin Topa tawh na kiciemna uh na tangtunzaw ding uhi,’ a kici thu na zahsa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hizongle ke’n kang ci-in, vantung tawh na kiciem vawt sih un, azieh pen tua khu Pasien’ topha ahi bo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />leitung tawh zong kiciem vawt sih un, azieh pen tua khu a keng ngahna ahi bo hi. Jerusalem tawh na kiciem sih un, a zieh pen tua khu Kumpi Lien pa’ khuopi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na lutang tawh kiciem sih un, azieh pen na samzam khat beh na kangsah thei sih vua, zong na vomsah thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na thugente a hite, ‘Hi’ ci unlen, ahi lote, ‘Hisih’ ci lel un; tua bansie poma gilopa kung pana ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“’Mittang’ tangin mittang, ha’ tangin ha,’ a kici thu na zahsa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, sietna bawlpa ledo sih un. Mi khatpo in na pang zietlam ang beh leh a lang khat zong na dawlai zaw in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />mi khatpo in na puon tungsil la nuomin thu ang bawl leh na puontuol zong na pie lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi khatpo in zawthaw thu tawh tai khat ang peisah leh tai ni dong na pei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na kunga ang ngente zosie na pie inlen, na kunga ang leitawi nuom poma na khia sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“’Na vengpa na it ding a, na galte na muda ding hi,’ a kici thu na zahsa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, na galte it unlen ang bawlsiete adingin thunget pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuaci’n note pen vantunga om na Pa uh’ tate na hi ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile ama in migilote tung le mihoite tungah ni tangsah a, midihte tung le midih lote tungah guo zusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Azieh pen no ang itte beh na it uleh bang thaman nga ding na hi uh ahei? Siehdongte nangawn in zong tua bangma-a a bawl uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na sanggamte beh na muoh vua ahile midangte sanga na tam sep tuonna uh bang hi ta ding ahei? Gentile-te nangawn in zong tua bang ma-in bawl uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin vantunga om na pa uh a cingtah ahi ma bangin no zong na cingtah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Biehna tawh kisai na sil bawlte uh midangte’ mu dinga na bawl lo nadingun pilvang un; bangzieh ahei cile tua banga na gamtat uleh vantunga om na Pa uh kung panin thaman na nga sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuaci’n note in silpieh na pieh sielun mihoi kipangte in midangte phat ding a dei ziehun kikhopna inn sung le lamdung tengah pengkul a mutsah bangin na pie sih un. A tahtah a kang ci-in, amate in a thaman uh a nga zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in silpieh na pieh uh ciengin na zietlam khut’ bawl na veilam khut in theisah da un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hileh na silpieh uh pen dappieh ahi ding hi; tua hile a dapmu na Pa un thaman ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thu na nget sielun mihoi kipangte na bang sih un; azieh pen amate in midangte’ mu theithei dingin kikhopna inn sung le lamkabawm lahpo-ah dinsa-in thu a ngen nuom sese uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin thu na nget sielun na innkhan sung vuah lutin kot khah unlen, mu thei lona muna om na Pa uh kungah ngen un; tua hile ang dapmu na Pa un note thaman ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thu na nget ciengun Gentile mite bangin kimanna nei lo kam tampi mawh sutsut sih un; azieh pen amate in tampi a nget ziehun a kiza deu ding a sa kha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu na nget masangun na Pa un na kisap teng uh thei zo ahi ziehin amate na bang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ahi ciengin tam bangin thu na ngen un: Vantunga om kohaw’ Pa aw, na min kizatah hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na gam hing tung taheh. Na deina vanah a kizui bangin leitung ah zong kizui taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nisim ka nehkhop ding uh an ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ko tunga ang mawte ka maisah ma bangun ka mawnate uzong ei maisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solna ei thuohsah sinlen, gilopa kung pan ei hunkhie in. Uh zawhna, vanglietna, minthanna nei tawntung ta in, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen midangte’ khielna na maisah uleh vantunga om na Pa un zong note’ khielna ang maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin midangte’ khielna na maisah sih uleh na Pa un zong note’ khielna ang maisah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“An na tan sielun mihoi kipangte bangin damai puo sih un, azieh pen amate in a antan uh midangte a lah nop ziehun a maisuo uh a siesah uhi. A tahtah a kang ci-in, amate in thaman a nga zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An na tan uh ciengin na lu uh sathau si unlen, na mai uh phiet siengzaw un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaci’n midangte in na an tan lam uh a mu sih vangun a simtham-a a om na Pa un ang mu veve ding hi; tua hile ang mudap na Pa un note thaman ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Nget in ne-in sam-eh a kai theina, gutate in lu-in a guh theina leitungah na goute uh khol sih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nget in a neh thei lona, sam-eh a kai thei lona, gutate in lu-in a guh thei lona mun vantungah na goute uh kholzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen na gou opna mun vuah na lungsim uzong a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mittang pen pumpi adingin khuovah ahi hi. Tuaci’n na mit uh a cim leh na pumpi tung zosie a vah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahi vangin na mit uh a cim sih leh na pumpi tung zosie uh a miel ding hi. Na sung vua a om khuovah pen khuomiel ahile bangza tahin a miel mawh ta diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Koima in to ni’ na sem zo lo hi; azieh pen sila pa in khat muda-in a khat it ding a, ahi sihle a khat belin adang khat simmaw ding hi. Note in Pasien’ na le leitung hauna’ na na semton zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin ke’n kang ci-in, bang ne-in bang ka dawn diei, ci-in na hinkhuo ading uh lunghimaw sih unlen, bang ka sil diei, ci-in zong na pumpi vua dingin lunghimaw sih un. Nehledawn sangin hinkhuo thupizaw a, silleten sangin pumpi thupizaw hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vana a leng vate en un; amate in khai a tu ngai sih vua, an la-in bem sungah a khol vateh sih uhi, hizongle vantunga om na Pa un tuate an a vah hi. Tuate sangin na manphazaw sam sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahile na lunghimaw ziehun note lahah na hinkhuo uh nai khat sung a sotto thei koi om na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bang dinga silleten ading lunghimaw na hi uh ahei? Gamlahah unoh paate khandan ngaisun vawi un; amate in na lah a sem sih vua, vau zong a zom ngai vateh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hizongle ke’n kang ci-in, Solomon nangawn a thupina zosie tawh a kizep ciengin tua paapete lahah khat zong a ban zo nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuni-in hing a, zing cienga meikhuh sungah a kipai lel ding gamlah lopate bawn Pasien in puon silsah ahileh no upna neu mite aw, ama in note puon ang silsah zawkan sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, ‘Bang ka ne diei?’ ahi sihle, ‘Bang ka dawn diei’ ahi sihle, ‘Bang ka sil diei’ ci-in lunghimaw sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen tam teng zosie adingin Gentile mite a hanciem uhi; tam teng zosie na kisap lam uh vantunga om na Pa un thei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasien’ manggam le ama’ dihna sui masa un, tua hile tam teng zosie zong ang kipiehbe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tua ahi manin zing cieng ading lunghimaw sih un, azieh pen zingcieng in ama adingin a lungkham na ding hi. Tuni’ buoina tuni adingin kicing gawp ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Note tunga thu ang kikhen lo nadingin midangte tungah thu khen sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen midangte tungah thu na khen ma bangin note tungah thu ang kikhen ding a, midangte na pieh zaza ma uh na ngakia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma’ mit sunga singluong om thei lopi-in na vengpa’ mit sunga buathah om bang dinga na muthaw sese ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi sihle nangma’ mit sunga singluong om kimlai na vengpa kungah, ‘Na mit sunga buathah nang lahpieh vang,’ bangci ci thei ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No mi kineitawmte aw, na mit sung vua singluong la masa phot un, tua zaw ciengin na vengpa’ mit sunga na lah ding uh buathah cientahin na mu thei pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A siengtho nate ui pie sih un; vohte mai-ah kep manphate pai sih un, na pai uleh a keng utawh sia gawpin, kihei-in ang hapkia lel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Ngen un, ang kipie ding hi; sui un, na mu ding uhi; kiu un, kot ang kihon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen a ngen zosie in nga a, a sui zosie in mu-in, a kiu zosie kot kihon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note lahah a tapa in anlum ngen leh suong pie ding koi na om uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi sihle a tapa in nga ngen leh gul pie ding koi na om uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No migilote bawn in na tate uh tungah sil hoi pieh dan ding thei na hi uleh, vantunga om na Pa un ama kunga a ngente tungah sil hoi tampitah pie zaw kan lai lo ding amah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na tung vua ang kibawl ding na dei bangun midangte tungah bawl un; azieh pen tami khu Moses’ thukham le kamsangte thugen bulpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kot kawcih ah lut un; sietna mun zotna kot golin a lampi a bai ziehin mi tampi in a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinna tun nading kot kawcihin a lampi a hamsat ziehin mi tawmno khat beh in a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A sungtawng ah ngie gongsan bang napi, tuu vun silin na kung vua ang pei zuouthei kamsangte lahah na pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate a ga tawh na thei pai lien ding uhi. Lingkung panin lengga kilo ngai-in thangling kung panin theiga a kilo ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ma bangin singkung hoi zosie in ga hoi ga a, ahi vangin singkung hoi lo zosie in ga hoi lo ga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Singkung hoi ah ga hoi lo a ga thei sih a, singkung hoi lo ah zong ga hoi a ga thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ga hoi a ga lo singkung zosie kiphua-in mei sungah kipai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua bangin amate a ga panun na thei pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Keima kungah, ‘ Topa , Topa , ei ci zosie vantung gam sungah a lut kim sih ding a, vantunga om ka Pa’ deina banga a gamtate beh a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mi tampi in keima kungah, ‘ Topa , Topa , na min tawh thu ka hil vua, na min tawh dawite hawlkhie-in, na min ma tawh sil thupi tampitah bawl hi lo uh ka mah?’ ei ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in amate kungah, ‘Note kang thei ngai vawt sih hi; sietna a bawl mite aw, ka kung panin pei dawh ta un,’ ka ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tua ciengin tam ka thugente za-in a zui zosiete suong tunga inn lam mipil pa tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Guo zu-in tui khang a, hui langin tua inn a nawh gawp vangin suong tunga kilam ahi ziehin a pua sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuale ka thugente za napi a zui nuom lo zosiete pen senel tunga inn lam mimaw pa tawh a kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Guo zu-in tui khang a, hui langin tua inn a nawh gawp ciengin, senel tunga kilam ahi ziehin tua inn a pua ta hi, tua inn pua nasie sam e izaw!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu-in Jesu in tam thute a gen zaw ciengin mipite in ama’ thuhilna lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in thukham hil siete bangin thuhil loin aana nei khat bangin amate thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Muol tung panin Jesu a kumsuh zaw ciengin mihon tampite in ama a zui uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale miphah khat ama kungah pei-in a mai-ah khupdin a, Topa aw, nei damsah nop leh nei damsah thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a khut zahin ama tham a, “Kang damsah nuom hi. Na siengtho ta in!” a ci hi. Thakhatthu-in a phah natna a dam pai lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Koima kungah gen malmal sin; ahi vangin siempu pa kungah va kilah ta’nlen amate kungah teci dingin Moses’ thupieh bangin biehna va pie ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Capernaum khuo ah a lut ciengin ama kungah mi zakhat a uh galkapbu khat pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa aw, ka nasempa zaw gawpin inn ah lum a, a natna thuohla mama hi,” ci-in ama kungah a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale ama in khumpa kungah, “Hing pei-in ama ka damsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Galkapmangpa in dawng a, “ Topa aw, ka inn sungah nangpipi ang lutsah dingin kilawm malmal sing; kamteng khat gen zieu lacin ka nasempa dam lel va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen kei zong thuneite khut sunga om ka hi a, ka khut nei-ah galkapte a om hi; tuale khat kungah, ‘Pei in,’ ka cileh pei a, adang khat kung ma-ah, ‘Hing pei in,’ ka cileh ang pei hi. Ka nasempa kungah, ‘Tami bawl in,’ ka cileh nasempa in a bawl pai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in a thugen a zah ciengin lamdangsa a, tuale ama a zuite kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, Israel-te sungah tam bang upna a nei koima ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, nisuona pan le ni tumna panin mi tampi ang pei-in vantung gam sungah Abraham, Isaac le Jacob-te tawh an a neton ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kumpi gam luo mite ahi uleh kaana le hagawina mun a pulam khuomiel lahah kipai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in galkapmangpa kungah, “Pei in; na upna bangin na tungah kibawl taheh,” a ci hi. Tua hun ma-in a nasempa a dam pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pater’ inn ah Jesu a lut leh ama in cithuo natna tawh lupna tunga a lum a sungnu a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in tua nu’ khut a thampieh leh a cithuo natna dam a, ama zong tho-in zindo a kipan pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khumi nitahin amate in dawivei mi tampitah ama kungah a peipi uhi; tuale ama in kamteng khat tawh dawite hawlkhie-in cinate zosie a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam pen, “Ama in i zawngkhalnate ladawh a, i natnate a puo hi,” ci-in kamsang Isaiah tungtawn a na kigensa thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu in a kimvelah mihon tampite a mu ciengin, ama in galkhat lama pei dingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham hil siepa khat a va pei ta a, “Siepa aw, na peina popo-ah kang zui ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in ama kungah, “Ngiete in kuo nei a, vana leng vate in bu a nei uhi; ahi vangin Mihing Tapa in a lu ngah nading mun a nei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nuazui dangte khat in ama kungah, “ Topa aw, va pei-in ka pa ei vuisah masa phot in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in ama kungah, “Keima ei zui in, misite in a misite uh vuisah lel in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gunkuong sungah ama a tuon ciengin a nuazuite in a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuipi tungah huipi nahpi-in langin tuihuolte in gunkuong a hlummang dihdih hi; ahi vangin ama a kimu ziuzieu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale amate pei-in Jesu a phong vua, “ Topa aw, kote ei hun ven! A simang ding ka hi ta uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Upna neu mite aw, bang dinga zau na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama tho-in huipi le tuipite a phawhsie leh a dai dide pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in lamdang a sa mama vua, “Huite le tuipi nangawn in a thu a man va-ia uh tampa bangci mi ahi diei?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuipi galkhat, Gadara mite’ gam a tun ciengin han panin dawivei mi ni pusuohin ama na dawntuo uhi. Ama gel a hansan seng ziehun tua lam a pei ngam koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama gel thakhatthu-in a kiko vua, “Pasien’ Tapa aw, ko tawh bang kisai laizang na hei? A hun tun masanga ko ei bawlsie dinga ang pei na hi amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate kung pan a gamla seng lo mun khatah voh hon tampi kikhawi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuale dawite in ama kungah, “Ko nawdawh nei sawm leh voh honpi lahah ei lutsah in,” ci-in a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuale ama in amate kungah, “Pei un!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate pusuohin voh honte sungah a lut uhi. Tua bepin voh honte luibang ken panin thakhatin kumsuhin tui sungah a si sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Voh cingte tai-in khuopi sungah a lut vua, amate in a thu omdan zosie le dawiveite tunga thupieng teng a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu dawn dingin khuozangin a pusuoh vua, ama a mu ciengun a gam panun a peidawh nadingin a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gunkuong tungah tuongin tuipi galkai a, ama’ khuo-ah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zaw lien ciengin mi pawlkhat in lupna tunga a lum phalsi khat a zawng uhi. Jesu in a upna uh a mu bepin ama in a pumzawpa kungah, “Ka ta aw; lungmuongin om in, na mawna mai zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham hil siete pawlkhat in, “Tampa in Pasien a gensie hi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle Jesu in a ngaisutna uh thei a, “Bang dingin gitlo lungsim ngaisun na hi uh ahei? a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen, ‘Na mawnate kimaisah zo hi,’ ci ding le, ‘Tho inlen pei in,’ ci ding koi baizaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Mihing Tapa in leitungah mawmaisah thei nading thu nei hi, ci note in na thei nadingun,” a ci zaw ciengin ama in phal si mipa kungah, “Tho in, na lupna puo inlen na inn ah pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale tua pa tho-in a inn ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihonpite in tam thu a mu uh ciengin lamdang a sa mama vua, amate in mihingte tunga tam bang thu neina a pie Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum mun panin Jesu a pei laitahin siehdonna zum sunga a to Matthew a kici mi khat mu hi; ama kungah, “Ei zui in,” a ci hi. Tuale ama dingto-in a zui pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn sungah nitah an ne-in a to laitahin siehdongte le mawneite tampi pei-in ama le a nuazuite tawh a toton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharisee-te in tam thu a mu ciengun amate in a nuazuite kungah, “Bang dinga na siepa un siehdongte le mawneite tawh an neton ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in tam thu a zah ciengin, “Sievuon a tulmaw pen cidamte hi loin cinate ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pei unlen, ‘Keima lunggul pen biehpiehna hi loin lainatna hizaw hi,’ a kici khu bang a cinopna ahei, va kan ta un. Azieh pen midihte hlan dinga ang pei ka hi sih a, mawneite hlan dinga ang pei ka hizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah John’ nuazuite pei a, “Bang dinga kote le Pharisee-te in an tang zelzel napi, na nuazuite in tang lo uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Zineipa tawh a omton laisie-un mopawi simte a da thei ding uh amah? Amate kung panin zineipa a kilah hun ang tung ding a, tua hun ciengin amate in an a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koima in puonbeh tha tawh puonlui phaw ngai lo hi, azieh pen a kiphawna puonbeh in puonlui kai-eh ding a, a ehbe zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Koima in savun um lui sungah lenggazu tha thal ngai lo hi; a thal khah leh tua lenggazu in savun um phukehin kibuo ding a, savun um zong kisie ding hi; savun um tha sungah lenggazu tha kithalzaw a, tuaci’n a ni-in kisawtkoi thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in tam thute amate kungah a gen laitahin thakhatthu-in kikhopna inn uhpa khat va pei-in ama mai ah khupdin a, “Ka tanu tu mama-in si ta; hinanle hing pei inlen a tungah na khut hing nga lacin a hingkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu zong ding pai-in a nuazuite tawh ama a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin thakhatthu-in kum sawm le kum ni sung siluong natna vei numei khat a nua lamah pei-in a puontuol mongtep a tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen a puontuol beh va khoi kha ta leng ka dam ta ding hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu zong kinuahei-in tua nu a mu ciengin ama in, “Ka tanu aw, lungmuongin om in; na upna in ang damsah zo ta hi,” a ci hi. Tuale thakhatthu-in numei nu a dam pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ulienpa’ inn ah Jesu a tun ciengin theile tum mite le mihonpi gamlum pialpual a mu ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ama in, “Kipei ta un; azieh pen numeino a si ahi sih a, a kimu ahi bo hi,” a ci hi. Tuale mihonpite in ama a nuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pulamah mihonpite a kipusuosah zaw ciengin a sungah ama tum a, a khut tawh a kai leh tua numeino a thoto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam thu kigen pen tua gamkuom tengah kizelmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khum panin Jesu a peidawh ciengin mittaw ni in a nua-ah zui-in, “David’ Tapa aw, kote ei khuotuo bo ven!” ci-in nahpi-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Inn sungah a lut ciengin ama kungah mittaw tegel a pei uhi; tuale Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Tami bawl thei dingin nei um vuoi mah? a ci hi. Ama gel in ama kungah, “Ingheh, Topa ” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a mit uh thampieh a, “Na upna uh dung zui-in na tung vuah pieng taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale a mit un khuo a mu pai lien hi. Tua ciengin Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Tam thu koima theisah sih gel in,” ci-in khautahin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama gel pei-in tua gamkuom tengah ama’ thu a thezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama gel a pei zaw ciengun dawivei a ham thei lo mi khat ama kungah kipeipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Dawi a kinawmang zaw ciengin a ham thei lo mipa a ham thei pai hi; tuale mihonpite in lamdang a sa mama vua, “Israel gam sungah tam bang thu a pieng ngai nai sih hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharisee-te in, “Dawimangpa’ vang tawh dawite kinotmang hi bo,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuopite le khuotate zosie-ah Jesu pei kawikawi a, a kikhopna uh innte ah thuhilin, vantung gam tawh kisai lungdamna thute tangko-in natna satna namkim a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite a mu ciengin a cing om lo tuute bangin cimaw le gimthuohin a om ziehun hepihuoi a sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Anlah ding tam mama a, ahi vangin nasem ding mi tawm mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama’ an a la dingin an nei Topa in nasemte ang sawl nadingin thu ngen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a nuazui sawm le nite hlan a, hlabuate a nawmang thei nading ule natna satna namkim a damsah thei nadingun amate tungah thuneina a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam teng pen sawltahpi sawm le nite’ min ahi hi: A masa penin, Peter zong a kici pa Simon, a sanggampa Andrew; Zebedee’ tapa James, le a sanggampa John;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philip le Bartholomew; Thomas le siehdongpa Matthew; Alphaeus’ tapa James, le Thaddaeus;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Canaan-te Simon, le ama a leheh Judas Iscariot-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu in tami mi sawm le nite tam bang thupiehna tawh a sawl hi: Gentile-te lah heima sungah pei loin Samaria-te khuo ah zong lut sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel innkuon a mangthai tuute kungah peizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pei kawmun, ‘Vantung gam ang tung bai ta ding hi’ ci-in lungdamna thu tangko un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cinate damsahin misite thosah unlen, miphahte damsahin dawite notmang un. Man pie loin na nga uhi; man ngen loin na pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kawnggah sung vuah kham ahi a, ngun ahi a, sumngo ahi zongin vom sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na khuolzinna vuah thung-ip hile, songkhol ni hile, kedap hile, ciengkhut hile keng sih un; bang ding ahei cile nasemte pen neh mu dinga kilawm mawng ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuopi ahi a, khuota ahi zongin na lut ciengun na tunna ding uh a kilawm kan unlen, na pei masangsie uh khumnah om den un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inn sung na lut ciengun hopi masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua inn tunna lawm ahileh amate tungah na thupha uh tung taheh; tunna lawm lo ahileh na thupha uh noma’ tungah kilekia taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Koima khat beh in ang tunsah nop sih a, na thugente uh a ngai nop sih leh, tua inn ahi sihle tua khuo na nuasie ciengun na keng vua leivuite thingkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, thukhen ni ciengin tua khuomite sangin Sodom le Gomorrah khuomite’ thuohna thuoh nuomzaw tham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En un, ngiehon lahah tuu kihla bangin note kang sawl hi; tuaci’n gul bangin pilvang unlen vakhu bangin nunnem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thukhenna zumah note hing tutin a kikhopna uh inn sungah hing satgawp ding ahi ziehin amate na kidawm un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuale keima ziehin gam-uhte le kumpite mai-ah thusit dingin ang kikai ding a, amate mai le Gentile-te mai-ah teci na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thusitna thuoh dingin ang kipeipi ciengin bangci genin bang gen ding ka hei ci lunghimaw sih un; azieh pen khum hun ciengin note tungah na gen ding uh ang kihil ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />bangzieh ahei a gen ding no hi loin no tungtawnin na Pa uh’ Hlagau in ang gen ding ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Unau le unau, a pa le a ta, thalup ding za dongin a kileheh ding vua, tate in zong nu le pate thalup dingin a langpan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima’ min ziehin mi zosie in ang muda ding uhi. Ahi vangin a tawpna donga a thuoh zote kihundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuo khatah ang bawlsiet uleh khuodang khatah tai un; azieh pen a tahtah a kang ci-in, Mihing Tapa ang pei masangin Israel khuote na tuonkim zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nuazui khat pen a siepa tungah om lo a, nasem khat zong a pupa tungah om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nuazui khat pen a siepa tawh a kibah a, nasem khat zong a pupa tawh a kibah leh pha zo hi. Inntehpa bawn Beelzabul a ci uleh a innkuonpite tua sangin a min a siesah zaw sih ding uh amah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuaci’n amate giing sih un; azieh pen a kilang lo dinga a kiphuol bangma om lo a, a kithei lo dinga a ki-im zong bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuomiel sunga ka thugente khuovah ah gen un; na bil kawm vua ang kidapgen na thuzahte uh, innkhumvum panin tangko un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tahsa a tha thei vangin hlagau a that thei lote na giing sih unlen, hell sunga tahsa le hla a ni-a a susie thei pa na giingzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vato ni ciengin paisa khat tawh kizua lel hi lo amah? Hinanle na Pa uh’ deina a op sih leh tuate lahah khat beh tuolah kiesuh lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na lu tung vua samzamte nangawn kisim sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin zau sih un; vato tampi sangin na manphazaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin midangte mai-a ei hum mi zosie, vantung ka Pa mai-ah ken zong ka hum ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ahi vangin midangte mai-a ei nuol poma ken zong vantung ka Pa mai-ah ka nuol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Leitung ah kilemna puoh dinga ang pei hi, ci-in ei ngaisun sih un; kilemna puoh dinga ang pei ka hi sih a, namsau leh dinga ang pei ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Azieh pen tapa le a pa, tanu le a nu, mo le innpinu a kidosah dinga ang pei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi khat’ gal pen a innkuonpi sung pan hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kei sanga a nu a pa a itzaw poma kei tawh kilawm lo hi; kei sanga a tapa a tanu a it zaw poma zong kei tawh kilawm lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tuale a singlamte puo-a ka nua ei zui lo poma kei tawh kilawm lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A hinna uh a mute in a tanlaw ding vua, keima zieha a hinna uh a tanlawte in a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“No ang sang poma kei ei sang hi pai a, kei ei sang poma in kei ei sawlpa zong a sang pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kamsang pa khat kamsang ahi zieha a sang poma in kamsangpa’ thaman nga ding a, midih khat a dih zieha a sang poma in midihte’ thaman a nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, tami naupangnote lahah khat popo keima’ nuazui ahina ziehin tuivot hai khat nangawn a pie poma in a thaman uh nga loin a om sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in a nuazui sawm le nite thu a hil zaw ciengin tua mun panin a khuopite vuah thuhil ding le thugen dingin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Messiah’ silbawlte John in thong sung pan a zah ciengin ama’ nuazuite sawlin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama kungah, “Ang pei ding kicipa nang na mah, awleh adang khat ka na kinem lai ding vuoi?” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Va pei unlen John kungah na zahsa ule na musa uh thu teng va gen ta un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mittawte in khuo mu a, khelbaite lam pei-in miphahte kidamsah a, bilbingte in khuoza-in misite kithosah a, mizawngte in lungdamna thu a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima tunga a lungkie lo poma thupha nga ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a pei laitahun John’ thu gen dingin Jesu a kipan hi: Bang en dinga gamlaha pei na hi vuoi? Hui’ sem a, a zam kawikawi pumpeng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi sihle bang en dinga pusuoh na hi uh ahei? Puon hoi sil mi pawlkhat en nuom na hi uh amah? En un, puon hoi silte kumpipa inn sungah om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahile bang pen en dinga pusuoh na hi vuoi? Kamsangpa khat amah? Hi hi, ke’n kang ci-in, kamsangpa sangin lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘En in, na masangah ka kamtaipa ka sawl ding a, ama in na mai-ah na pei nading lampi a na sielkhol ding hi,’ ci-a kigiel pa khu tampa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, numeite sung panin a suohte lahah Baptize-pa John sanga a lienzaw koima a om sih hi; hizongle vantung gam sungah a neu pen nangawn ama sangin lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptize-pa John hun a kipan tuni dongin vantung gam in zawthaw bawlna na thuoh a, tua mi zothawte in thagum hatna a suong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile John hun dongin kamsangte zosie le thukham in a na magen zo ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tam thu na san nuom uleh ama pen ang pei ding Elijah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zah nading bil nei tapo in za taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tam khang mite bang tawh gente bep ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vanzuana munah amate to a, ‘Theile ka tum vangun na lam nuom sih uhi; kaa la ka sah vangun na kap nuom tuon sih uhi,’ ci-a khatlekhat a kigal hlat naupangte tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen bangma ne lo dawn loin John ang pei-in amate in, “Dawi lawmnei pa hi,’ a ci uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing Tapa ang pei ciengin ne-in dawn a, ‘En un, anhai zuhai pa, siehdongte le mawneite’ guolpa,’ ci zel uhi. Ahi vangin pilna pen a sepnate in a man ahina lah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin na lamdang a bawlna khuopite a kisiakia lo ziehun Jesu in tua khuomite a hosie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Chorazin khuopi aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Bethsaida khuopi aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Bangzieh ahei cile na sung vua kibawl vanglietna nasepnate, Tyre le Sidon khuo-a kibawl hi poma leh sawtlaipi-in la-ip puon silin vut kibuohin a kisiakia zo ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, thukhen ni ciengin no thuoh ding sangin Tyre le Sidon khuote thuohna nuomzaw lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale nang, Capernaum aw, vantung dongin ang kitawisang ding amah? Hi lo hi, Misikhuo dongah ang kikhiesuh ding hi. Azieh pen nang tunga ang kibawl na lamdangte, Sodom khuo-a kibawl hi poma leh tuni dongin tua khuopi om lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, thukhen ni ciengin no thuoh ding sangin Sodom thuohna nuomzaw lai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khum hunin Jesu in, “Lei le van Topa ka Pa aw, tam thute mipilte le misiemte na im a, naupangte tungah tam thute na lah ziehin nangma tungah nuomthu kang tut hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />hi hi, ka Pa, tam bang pen na hepina zala nangma’ deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka Pa in keima tungah na vannuoi ei ap zo ta hi; tuale pa simlo Tapa a thei koima om lo a, Tapa le ama a lah thei nadinga Tapa in a teel mite simlo Pa a thei koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Vangih puo a, a gim mi zosie aw, ka kungah hing pei un, toidamna kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka hahkol puo unlen keima kungah hing kisin un; azieh pen kei khu mi nunnem le mi kiniemkhieh pa ka hi a, note in na hlagau adingin toidamna na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen ka hahkol a puohnop a, ka van zong a zang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Jesu in sabbath ni-in mangbu lei nawhin a pei hi; a nuazuite a gil uh kiel a, amate in a neh dingun buvui a zut uhi .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharisee-te in a mu bepun ama kungah, “En in, sabbath ni-in thukham tawh kituoh loin na nuazuite a gamta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “David le a guolte a gilkiel laitahun a gamtatna uh na sim ngai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien’ biehinn sungah lutin ama le a guolte neh dinga kilawm lo, siempute beh neh thei ahi Ompina anlum a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi sihle biehinn sunga om siempute in sabbath a tan lo vangun khiel a tang tuom sih uhi, ci thu thukham sungah na sim ngai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, tam munah biehinnpi sanga a lienzaw khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin, ‘Biehpiehna ka dei sih a, khuotuona ka deizaw hi,’ ci thu a khietna thei locin khielna nei lote na mawmat sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Mihing Tapa khu sabbath ni uhpa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum mun pan pei-in a kikhopna inn vuah a lut hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua tahah a khutzaw mi khat om a, amate in a mawsah thei nadingun ama kungah, “Sabbath ni-in cina damsah ding a kilawm ma amah? ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Note lahah mi khat in tuu khat nei hinlen, sabbath ni-in dum sungah kie leh; tua tuu va kai-in na lakhie sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuu sangin mihing bangza tahin manphaw zaw ahei! Tuaci’n sabbath ni-in sil hoi sep ding kilawm hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin khutzaw pa kungah, “Na khut zah vawi,” a ci hi. Ama in a khut a zah leh alang khat bangin dam sieng pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharisee-te peikhie-in ama tha nading a geldap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu in tam thu a thei bepin kihemkhie hi. Mi tampite in ama a zui uhi, tuale ama in a natna zosie uh damsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />koima kungah ama’ thu a gen lo nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam pen kamsangpa Isaiah tungtawna kigen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka it mama, ei lungdamsah, ka teelsa ka nasempa tanah om hi. Ama tungah ka hlagau ka koi ding a, ama in Gentile-te tungah thutang a tangko ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tawh kisel loin awsang tawh kiko lo ding a, gawl dung lahah zong a aw kiza lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in thutang a guolzawsah masangsie, a zamsa pumpeng hliehtawng lo ding a, a kuong pimpem meivah detna gui zong mitsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ minin Gentile mite a kinem ding uhi, ci thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in mittawt le ham thei lo a thuo dawivei mi khat ama kungah a peipi uhi; tuale ham thei-in khuo a mu thei nadingin ama in tua mipa a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihonpite zosie in lamdang a sa vua, “Tampa David’ Tapa ahi thei kha diei izaw?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hizongle Pharisee-te in tam thu a zah ciengun, “Dawimangpa Beelzebul suongin dawigilote a hawlkhiet ahi bo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in a ngaisutna uh thei a, amate kungah, “Amau le amau kido-in a kikhenthang gam zosie mangthai ding a, khuopi ahi a, innkuon khat ahi zongin ama le ama kido-in a kikhenthang leh a kip zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Satan in Satan notmang leh ama le ama a kikhenthang ahi hi; tua hile ama’ gam bangci kip thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Beelzebul suongin dawite a notmang ka hi leh na nawmang uh dawite in koi suongin tuate notmang uh ahei? Tua ahi ziehin amate pen note tungah thukhente a suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ Hlagau tawh dawigilote a notmang ka hi leh note tungah Pasien’ manggam ang tung ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi sihle koi in mi thahatpa lep-ia masa lopi-in a inn bulu-in a neisate lahpieh thei ding ahei? A lep-ia zaw ciengin a inn sung bulu thei pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kei lama pang lo poma kei ei langpang ahi a, kei ei kaikhoppi lo poma a thethang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ziehin ke’n kang ci-in, mi mawna vannuoi le Pasien a gensietnate uh kimaisah ding a, hizongle Hlagau langpangin a gensiete kimaisah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing Tapa langpanga thugente kimaisah ding a, ahi vangin Hlagau Siengtho langpanga thugen poma tu khangah ahi a, ang tung ding khangah ahi zongin kimaisah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“A kung a hoi leh a ga hoi hi, na ci unlen a kung a hoi sih leh a ga zong hoi lo hi, na ci un; azieh pen singkung a ga tawh kithei thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />No muoltan suonte aw! Migilo na hi ciengun sil hoi bang na ci gen thei ding uh ahei? Azieh pen lungsim sunga a dimlet thute kam tawh a genkhiet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mihoi pa in sil hoi kholna panin a hoite suokhie a, migilo pa in sil hoi lo kholna panin a hoi lote a suokhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, note in na thu motgente zosie uh ziehin thukhen ni ciengin thusitna na thuoh ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />azieh pen na thugente ziehin dih na tang ding a, na thugente zieh ma-in mawsahna na thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham hil sie pawlkhat le Pharisee-te in ama kungah, “Siepa aw, “Nang tung panin lim lamdang khat ka mu nuom uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in amate kungah, “A gilo le angkawm hat khang mite in lim lamdang sui a, ahi vangin amate tungah kamsang Jonah’ lim losie bangma lim kipie lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Azieh pen ngapi gil sungah Jonah sun thum le zan thum a op ma bangin Mihing Tapa zong lei sungah sun thum le zan thum a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Thukhen ni ciengin tami khangmite langah Nineveh mite dingin a mawsah ding uhi, azieh pen Jonah’ thuhilna ziehin amate a kisiakia uhi, tuale en un, tam tahah Jonah sanga a lienzaw khat a om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thukhen ni ciengin tam khang mite langah Leitaw lam gam kumpinu dingin a mawsah ding hi, azieh pen tua nu in Solomon’ pilna thu ngai dingin leimong khat panin a pei hi, tuale en un, tam tahah Solomon sanga a lienzaw khat a om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Mi khat sung panin hlabua a pusuo zaw ciengin khawl nading mun sui-in tui op lona munah vah kawikawi a, ahi vangin khat beh a mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, ‘Ka puokhietna inn ma-ah kilekia bo vang,’ a ci hi. Ama a tun leh tua inn na awng a, kiphiet sieng sinsenin hoitaha om a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin kilekia-in ama sanga a gilozaw hla dang sagi zawpi a, amate lutin tua sungah a teng uhi; tua mipa’ opdan nukhia pen a masa hun lai sangin a siezaw hi. Tami a gilo khangmite zong tua ma bangin a om ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mihonpite tawh a kiho laitahin a nu le a sanggamte ama hopi nuomin a pulamah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi khat in ama kungah, “En in, na nu le na sanggamte, ang hopi nuomin a pulamah ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in ama kunga tam thu a genpa kungah, “Ka nu koi hi a, ka sanggamte koi ahi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama in a nuazuite kawhin, “Tamte khu ka nu le ka sanggamte ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Azieh pen vantunga om ka Pa’ deina banga a gamta mi poma ka sanggam pasal, ka sanggam numei le ka nu ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in tua inn panin Jesu peikhie-in tuili gei-ah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kimkot ah mihonpite a tam seng ziehin gunkuong sungah pei-in to a, mihonpite ahile tuili gei-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale ama in amate kungah gentena tawh thu tampi a gen hi: Ngai un! Khaici vawpa khaici vaw dingin a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaici a vaw ciengin kimkhat lam lai-ah kie a, vate lengin a netum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khaici dangte suong tamna lei lahah kie a, leitang a thuh lo ziehin a popah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin ni a suo ciengin nisa kahin gawpmang hi; zung hla lo uh ahi ziehin vulnang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khaici dangte ahile lingkawm lahah kie a, tua lingkungte khangin a depgawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaici dangte lei hoina munah kie a, pawlkhatte a za zakhat, pawlkhatte a za sawmguh, pawlkhatte a za sawmthumin ga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zah nading bil nei tapo in za ta uheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nuazuite pei-in ama kungah, “Amate tungah bang dinga thugentena tawh thu na gen ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Note tungah Vantung gam thusimte theitheina ang kipieh vangin amate tungah kipie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a neite kipiehbe ding a, tampitah nei ding hi; ahi vangin bangma nei lote kung panin a nei sun nangawn kilahpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate tungah thugentena tawh ka genna a hang pen, ‘Amate in enen napi mu thei loin, ngaingai napi a za thei sih vua, zong a tel thei sih uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kamsang Isaiah a genkhol thute amate tungah a tung tahtah hi: ‘Na zaza ding vua, ahi vangin na thei zo sih ding uhi. ‘Na enen ding vua, ahi vangin na mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in a mit utawh en loin a bil utawh a za sih vua, a lungtang utawh thei siem loin kei lamah ang kihei lo nadingun, tam mite’ lungsim mawl mama a, a bilte un khuo za loin a mit a sing uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin na mit un mu-in na bil un a zah ziehin thupha nga na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tahtahin kang ci-in, kamsangte le midih tampite in na sil mute uh mu nuom mama napi mu loin, na thuzahte uh za nuom mama napi a za sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua ciengin khaici vawpa thugentena ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi khatpo in Pasien gam thu za napi a theisiem sih leh, gilopa pei-in a lungtang sunga a kivawsate a lahpieh hi; tam bangte pen lampi dunga kitute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suong lahah kitute ahile mi pawlkhat in thu a zah behun lungdamin a pompai uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hinanle tua mipa zung thuh hla lo ahi ziehin bakhat sung beh hing a, tuami thu ziehin gimna ahi sihle bawlsietna a tun ciengin thakhatin a puakia pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ling lahah kitute ahile thu za napi leitung lunghimawnate le hau nopnate in tua thute depgawp ahi ziehin a ga lote ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin lei hoina muna kitute ahile thu a zah ciengun a theitel pai mite ahi a, tuate a ga ga pai a, khatvei a za zakhat, khatvei a za sawmguh, khatvei a za sawmthum a ga mite ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah thugentena dang khat gen a: “Vantung gam pen ama’ lo lai-a khaici hoi a vaw mi khatpo tawh kigente thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ahi vangin mi zosie a kimut kalin galpa khat pei-in mangbu lahah tamom vaw a, tua ciengin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n ankungte khangin a ga ang ga a, tua zaw ciengin tamomte ang kidawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuale inntehpa’ silate pei-in ama kungah, ‘Pu aw, na lo lai-ah khaici hoi vaw hi lo na mah? Tua ahile tam tamomte hei pana ang pei ahei?’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Tua pen galpa khat’ bawl ahi hi,’ ci-in a dawng hi. Silate in ama kungah, “Tua ahile pei-in ka va bawmang ding uh nei awi ei mah’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in dawngkia a, ‘Bot sih un; azieh pen tamomte bot locin bu tawh na botton kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anlah hun masangsie a nipi-in khangton tadi heh; anlah hun ciengin anlate kungah, ‘Tamomte khawm unlen haltum dingin lomhen un, ahi vangin bute khawmin ka ansal sungah khol un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah thugentena dang khat gen a: “Vantung gam pen mi khat in la-in a lo lai-a a vaw ankam tang tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua pen khaici zosie lahah a neu pen ahi vangin ang gol ciengin ankungte lahah golpen a, singkung ang suoh hi, tuaci’n vana leng vate in a bazamte tungah bu a tom uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah thugentena dang khat gen a: “Vantung gam pen numei khat in tol la-in bunel hai thum tawh sawhalin, a unpi-in a zel sieng masangsie-a a saw tol tawh kibang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in tam thute zosie thugentena tawh mipite kungah a gen hi; thugentena zang loin amate kungah bangma gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tam pen kamsangpa tungtawna kigen: Thugentena tawh ka kam kahin thu ka gen ding hi; leitung piencila kipanin a ki-imcip thute ka genkhie ding hi,” ci thu a tangtunna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in mihonpite nuasie-in inn sungah a lut hi. Tuale a nuazuite in ama nehin, “Lo lai-a tamom thugentena ei hilcien in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in, “Khaici hoi vawpa pen Mihing Tapa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />lo lai pen leitung hi-in, khaici hoi pen kumpi gam sung tate ahi uhi; tamomte ahile gilopa’ tate ahi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuate a vaw galpa pen dawimangpa ahi hi; anlah hun pen leitung hun tawp hun ahi a, anlate ahile vantung mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tamomte kibotin mei tawh a kihaltum ma bangin, leitung tawp hun ciengin tua bangin a pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihing Tapa in a vantung mite sawl ding a, gam sungah mawna a piengsah mi zosie le sietna a bawl mite zosie a gam sung panin nil dawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />amate in meikhuhpi sungah sep ding a, khum tahah kaana le hagawina a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin midihte ahile a Pa uh’ gam sungah ni bangin a tang ding uhi. Zah nading bil nei teng in za ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Vantung gam pen lo lai-a a kiphuol gou tawh kibang a, mi khat in tua gou a mu ciengin phuoldap hi; tua ciengin lungdamin pei-in a neisa zosie zua-in tua lo a lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Khat leuleu ah vantung gam pen kep manpha a sui sumbawlpa tawh kibang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />a tam man mama kep khat a mu ciengin ama pei-in a neisa zosie zua-in tua kep a lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Khat leuleu ah vantung gam pen tuipi sunga a kipai, nga namcin a awhna len tawh kibang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />tua len a dim ciengin amate in pieu gei-ah kaikhie-in a tosuh vua, a hoi teng paai sungah guongin a hoi lo teng a paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaci’n hun tawp ni ciengin tua bangin a pieng ding hi. Vantung mite hing pei-in midihte lah panin migilote khenkhie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />meikhuhpi sungah amate sepsuh ding a, tua tahah kaana le hagawina om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Tam thute zosie na theikim ta vuoi mah?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Ingheh,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuale ama in a kung vuah, “Tua ahi ziehin vantung gam adinga a kisinsa laitheite ahi ule a gou pana a tha le a lui a suokhie inntehpa tawh kibang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Jesu in tami thugentenate a gen zaw ciengin khum mun panin a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ama’ khuo a tun ciengin a kikhopna uh inn sungah mite thuhil kipan a, tuaci’n amate in lamdang sa-in, “Tam mipa in tam bang pilna le sil thupi bawl theinate hei sung pana a nga viel adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Khutsiempa’ tapa hi lel lo amah? A nu zong Mary kici nu hi lo amah? A sanggamte zong khu James, Joseph, Simon le Judas ahi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A sanggam numeite zosie zong eite tawh omton ahi sih uh amah? Tua ahile tam mipa in tam teng zosie hei pana a nga ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tuale amate in ama a nuol uhi. Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah, “Kamsangte amau’ gam le amau’ inn sung longal-ah zatahna nga loin a om sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ama in a up lona uh ziehin khum sungah na lamdang tampi bawl lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hunin gam-uhpa Herod in Jesu’ thu a kigenna a za hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale ama in a nasemte kungah, “Tam pa, baptize-pa John ahi hi; sina pana ang thokia hi ngel ding hi, tua ziehin na lamdang bawl theina vang nei hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Herod in a naupa Philip’ zi Herodias ziehin John man a, khau tawh henin thong sungah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum pen John in Herod kungah, “Tua nu na kinunpi kilawm lo hi,” a ci zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Herod in ama a tha nop vangin ama in mihonpite a giing hi, azieh pen amate in ama kamsang khatin ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Herod’ suopawi ni a tun ciengin mipite mai-ah Herodias’ tanu a lam ziehin tua nu in Herod lungkimsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaci’n ama kiciemin tua nu nget popo pieh dingin kamciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua nu in a nu hil bangin, “Kuongdai khat sungah Baptize-pa John’ lutang tamtahah ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa da mama a, ahi vangin a kiciemnasa ahina zieh le a lenglate’ maitang a zatahna ziehin pieh dingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in mi sawlin thong sungah John’ lutang a tansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lutang kuong tawh hing kitawi-in tua numeino kipie a, tua nu in a nu a piesawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nuazuite pei-in a luong la-in a vui uhi; tua ciengin amate pei-in Jesu kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesu in tam thu a zah ciengin gunkuong khatah tuongin tua mun panin gamdaina munah a kihemkhie hi. Ahi vangin mipite in tam thu a zah ciengun khuopite panin keng tawh pei-in a nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuipieu ah a tun ciengin ama in mihon tampi mu hi; tuale ama in amate khuotuo-in a cinate a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuomiel kuon ciengin ama kungah nuazuite pei-in, “Tam mun pen gamlah ahi a, i vaikai ta uhi; a neh ding uh lei dingin mihonte khuo sungah sawl dawh ta’n,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “A pei ding uh kisam sih; a neh ding uh bang po khat pie lel un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in, “Anlum nga le nga tawn ni simlo tanah bangma dang nei sih ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Tua teng tanah hing la ta vawi uh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in mipite lopa tunga to dingin thu a pie hi. Ama in anlum nga le nga tawn ni la-in vantung lam ento-in lungdam ko a, anlumte phalsuo-in nuazuite a pie hi, tuale nuazuite in mipite a piesawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi zosie in ne-in a gilva mama uhi; tuale a khawnla teng uh a neng a themin a khawmkia vua, seu sawm le seu ni a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An ne mi pen numei le naupang simlo pasal cingteng mi tulnga bang pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite a peisah laitahin a nuazuite thakhatin gun kuong tungah tuongsah a, galkhat lamah a peisah masa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihonpite a peisah zaw ciengin thungen dingin muol tungah ama tangin a peito hi. Khuo a miel ciengin tua tahah ama tangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin khumi hunin gunkuong pen lei panin gamlapi tung ta a, hui in amate a lemut ziehin tuihuolte in gunkuong a satsat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zingmawng phalvah hunin amate lam zuonin tui tungah ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hizongle a nuazuite in tui tunga a pei ama a mu ciengun, “Thadam a khula!” ci-in zausi-in a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanle Jesu in thakhatin amate hopi a, “Na lungsim hangsah un, keima ka hi bo hi; zau sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Peter in, “ Topa aw, tua khu nang na hi ngel leh kei zong na kung zuonin tui tunga kang pei nading thu ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in, “Hing pei in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n gunkuong tung panin Peter kumin Jesu lam zuonin tui tungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin hui husiepi a mu ciengin zau-in tui sungah tumsuh dihtah a, tua bepin ama in, “ Topa aw, ei hun ven!” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu in thakhatin a khut tawh zamin man phei pai a, ama kungah, “Upna neu mipa aw, bang dinga lunghimaw na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gunkuong tung a kato ciengun tua hui a theu pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gunkuong sunga om teng in, “Pasien’ Tapa tahtah na hi hi,” ci-in ama a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate a galkai zaw ciengun Gennesaret gamah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum muna mite in ama a theitel zaw ciengun amate in tua gam mun cintengah thu zasahin cina zosie ama kungah a peipi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tuale amate in ama’ puontuol tep nangawn a tham thei nadingun ama kungah a thum uhi; a thamkha zosie in damna a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharisee-te le thukham hil siete, Jesu kungah a va pei ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nuazuite in bang dinga tanglai upate’ ngaina a palsat uh ahei? Azieh pen an a neh ciengun a khut a sil masa sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Note in zong na tang ngaina uh na zui nop na lam vua bang dinga Pasien’ thupieh na palsat uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien in, ‘Na nu le na pa zatah in,’ ci-a, tuale, ‘A nu ahi a, a pa ahi zongin a gensie poma a si valon ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in mi khatpo in a nu le a pa kungah, ‘Kei tung pana na nga ding uh huna poma Pasien tunga kipie ahi hi, a ci nah leh, tua pa in a pa a patawi ding kul nawn lo hi,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n tang ngaina na zui ziehun note in Pasien’ thu na phietmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />No mihoi kipangte! Isaiah in note tawh kisai-in thu a na genkholna khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tam mite in a kampi utawh kei ei zatah bawl vua, ahi vangin a lungtang uh kei tawh a kigamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in mihingte’ bawltawm ngainate, zui ding ngaina bangin a hil vua, a mawhna-in kei ei bie uhi,’ a ci pen a man ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in mihonpite ama kungah hlan a, “Ngai unlen theisiem un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kam sunga a tumsuh nate in mi buasah lo a, kam sung pana a pusuoh nate in mi buasah zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin nuazuite in ama nehin a kungah, “Pharisee-te in na thugen a zah ciengun a lungkim lo lam uh na thei ei mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “ Vantunga om ka Pa in a suon lo singkung kici poma kibotmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate donin zong nei da un; mittaw le mittaw lam kihilte ahi uhi. Mittaw khat in mittaw dang khat lam hil leh, a ni gelin guom sungah kie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter in ama kungah, “Tami thugentena ko ei hilcien in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Note in zong theitel nai lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kam sunga a tumsuh poma gilpi sungah tumsuh a, khum panin a pusuo lam na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kam sung pana a pusuohte lungtang pana ang pieng hi a, tuami in mi buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen lungtang panin ngaisutna hoi lote, tuol thana, numei-pasal pahtatna, angkawmna, guhtatna, zuou teci panna le mi gensietna- te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamte mi buasah thei nate hi a, ahi vangin khut sil lo-a an nehna in mi buasah lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in khum mun nuasie-in Tyre le Sidon gam sung tengah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zaw behin khum gam panin numei khat a va pei ta a, “David’ tapa, Topa aw, ei hepi in; dawi gilo khat in ka tanu bawlsie hi,” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in tua nu a dawng vawt sih hi. Tuale a nuazuite pei-in, “Tua nu in i nua ei zui-in a kikoko ziehin ama peisah dawh ta’n,” ci-in a hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, “Israel innkuon a mangthai tuute kung beha ei kisawl ahi bo hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua nu pei-in a mai-ah khupdin a, Topa aw, ei hu bo ven,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in, “Tate’ neh ding an lahpiehin uite pieh ding kilawm lo hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Hi ma hi, Topa aw, ahi vangin uite nangawn in a pute’ sabuoi pana a kie annengte a ne uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua bepin tua nu kungah, “Numei aw, na upna lien mama ei! Na deina bangin nang adingin pieng taheh,” ci-in a dawng hi. Tuale thakhatthu-in a tanu a dam pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in khum mun a nuasie zaw ciengin Galilee Tuipi dung kantanin pei a, tuale muol tungah kato-in a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama kungah mihon tampi tah pei-in khelbaite, a poite, mittawte, a ham thei lote, le adang tampi tah a peipi uhi. Amate in ama’ keng phungah tuate a koi vua, ama in tuate a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n a ham thei lote hamin, a poite dam sieng a, khelbaite lam pei-in, mittawte in khuo a mukia theina thu mihonpite in a mu uh ciengin lamdang a sa uhi. Tuale amate in Israel Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah a nuazuite hlan a, “Mihonpite ka khuotuo hi, azieh pen ka kunga a om zaw uh tu-in ni thum pha ta a, a neh ding uh bangma a nei sih uhi; tuale lamkalah basam kha thei ding uh ahi ziehin gilkielsa-in amate ka peisah nuom sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nuazuite in ama kungah, “Tam bang gamlahah mihon tam zapi vah nading a kicing an hei pana i nga ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Anlum bangza na nei vuoi?” ci-in dong hi. Amate in, “Lum sagi le nga neu halkhat om hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in lei lahah mihonpite a to nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuale ama in anlum sagi le nga la-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin phalsuo-in nuazuite kungah pie a, tuale nuazuite in zong mihonpite tungah a piesawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un ne-in a gil uh a va mama hi; tuale a khawnla teng uh a neng a themin a khawm uleh seu sagi a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua an nete numei le naupang simlo mi tul li pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite a pei dinga a sawl zaw ciengin gunkuong tungah kato-in Magadan gamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu ze-et dingin Pharisee-te le Sadducee-te pei-in van panin amate lim khat a lah nadingin ama kungah a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Nitah ciengin, ‘Meiisan suoh ahi ziehin khuo ko ding hi,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin, ‘Meiisan suohin meii a niim ziehin tuni-in huipi lang ding hi,’ na ci uhi. Note in van omzie na gen thei vangun hun lahna limte na theithei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A gilo le angkawm khang mite in lim lamdang ngen uhi, ahi vangin amate tungah Jonah’ lim longal bangma lim kipie lo ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin amate nuasie-in a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nuazuite a galkhatah a tun ciengun an puoh ding a mangngil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Pharisee-te le Sadducee-te’ tol panin kikem unlen pilvang un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat, “Anlum i puoh lo zieh hi va,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu in tua thu a thei ciengin, “No upna neu mite aw, bang dinga anlum na nei lona thu uh kikum na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na phawh thei nai lai sih uh amah? Mi tul nga in anlum nga a khamval seu bangza na luoh vuoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi sihle mi tul li in anlum sagi a khamval seu bangza na luoh vuoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangci-a an thu ka gen lo lam phawh thei talawm lo na hi uh ahei? Pharisee-te le Sadducee-te’ tol panin na kikem un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin anlum kisaw tol gen hi loin Pharisee-te le Sadducee-te’ thuhilna gen ahi zawh lam a phawh pan na bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Caesarea Philippi gam sungah Jesu a tun ciengin, ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Mite in Mihing Tapa koi hi, ei ci vuoi?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale, “Pawlkhat in Baptize-pa John hi, ang ci uhi; pawlkhat in Elijah hi, ang ci uhi; adang pawlkhatte leuleu in Jeremiah ahi sihle kamsang khat popo hi va, ang ci uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Tua ahile note in kei koi hi, nei ci vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Simon Peter in, “Nang a hing zing Pasien Tapa Messiah na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in ama kungah, “Jonah’ tapa Simon aw, thupha nga na hi hi! Azieh pen tam thu tahsa le sisan in ang theisah ahi sih a, vantunga a om ka Pa in nangma tunga ang theisah ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, nang Peter na hi a, tami suongpi tungah ka hlattuom pawlpi ka lam ding hi, Misi khuo kotpite in tua hlattuom pawlpi a zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vantung gam tawhtangte nang kang pie ding a, leitunga na hen poma vantungah zong kihen ding a, leitunga na sut poma vantungah zong kisut ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama Messiah ahi lamtah koima kungah a gen lo nadingun khautahin nuazuite thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Jesu pei-in ama in upate, siempu liente, thukham hil siete khut sungah gimna lienpi thuoh valon ding a, tuale ama kithatin a ni thum ni-in kithosah ding hi, ci thute khum hun a kipanin a nuazuite a theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale Peter in ama tuom peipi-in phawhsie a, “ Topa , Pasien in tam thu piengsah vawt sih heh! Nang tungah tam thu pieng ngai poma lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu kihei-in Peter kungah, “Satan, ka nua lamah kihem vawi! Pasien’ nate tungah na lungsim na koi sih a, mihing’ nate tungah na koi zawh ziehin kei adingin kipalpuana na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a nuazuite kungah, “Mi khatpo ka nuazui a suo nop leh, a deina nuolin a singlamte puo-in ei zui ta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen amau’ hinna a hundam nuomte in a hinna uh tan ding a, keima zieha a hinna a taante in a hinna uh a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in leitung buppi a nga vangin a hinna uh suplaw uleh bang phattuomna nga ding uh ahei? Ahi sihle a hinna uh bang tawh hleng theikia ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Azieh pen a Pa’ minthanna vang le a vantung mite tawh Mihing Tapa ang pei ding a, tua ciengin ama in a sepna utawh kizui-in mi zosie a thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, tam sunga a ding mi pawlkhat in a kumpi gam tawh Mihing Tapa ang pei a mu masangun sina a ciemkha sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni guh zaw ciengin Jesu in Peter, James le a nau John-te zawpi-in muol sang tung khatah a katopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale amate mai-ah a mel kikhelin a mai ni bangin tang a, a puonsilte zong vam lihleh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum tahah Moses le Elijah thakhatin kilang a, ama tawh a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in Jesu kungah, “ Topa aw, tam sunga i op ding uh a hoi hi; nei awi leh keima in tanah tenna ding buh thum, nang ading khat, Moses ading khat, Elijah ading khat kang lampieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua banga thu a gen laitahin meiingo khat in amate tuommang a, tua meii lah panin, “Tam pa ka it mama ka Tapa ahi hi; ama tungah ka lung a kim hi; ama’ thu na ngai un!” ci-in aw khat a ging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuazuite in tami awging a zah ciengun zausi-in tuolah a khupbawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu pei-in amate tham a, tho un, zau sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate a khuoda ciengun Jesu longal koima a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Muol tung pan a kumsuh laitahun Jesu in amate kungah, “Sina panin Mihing Tapa a thawkia masangsie, na sil mute uh koima kungah gen sih un,” ci-in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nuazuite in ama kungah, “Tua ahile bang dinga thukham hil siete in Elijah ang pei masa ding hi, a ci uh ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Elijah ang pei tahpi-in na zosie a bawlpha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin note kunga kang ci-in, Elijah ang pei zo napi amate in a thei lo ziehun ama tungah a dei bangun a na bawl uhi. Tua ma bangin Mihing Tapa in zong amau’ khut sungah gimna a thuoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Baptize-pa John’ thu a gen ahi lamtah nuazuite in a theitel pan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihonte kungah amate a tun ciengun ama kungah pasal khat pei-in a mai-ah khupdin a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Topa aw, ka tapa hing khuotuo in; azieh pen ama bupsi-in a gim mama hi; meikhuh sung le tui sungah a pua zelzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nuazuite kungah ka peipi vangin amate in a damsah zo sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesu in, “No upna nei lo a letat khangmite aw, note tawh bang tanve hing om ding ka hei? Bang tanvei note hing thuohpi ding ka hei? Ka kungah ama hing peipi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesu in dawi a hosiet ciengin a kung panin ama pusuoh a, thakhatin naupang pa dam pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu kungah nuazuite pei dapin, “Bang dinga tua dawi ka hawlkhiet zo lo uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Na upna uh a neu zieh ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile a tahtah a kang ci-in, ankam tang cie upna na nei nah uleh tami muolpi kungah, ‘Tam panin khum tahah kikhin in,’ ci locin a kikhin ding hi; note adingin a pieng thei lo bangma a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in thungetna le antanna longal tawh tam bang namte kihawlkhie zo lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Galilee gamah a kikhop laitahun Jesu in amate kungah, “Mihingte khut sungah Mihing Tapa kileheh ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate in ama thatin ni thum ni-in a thokia ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale amate a da mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Capernaum khuo ah amate a tun ciengun Peter kungah biehinnpi’ sieh dongte pei-in, “Na siepa un biehinn sieh a khie sih amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in, “Ingheh, pie ma,” a ci hi. Innah ama a pei ciengin Jesu in na hopi masa a, “Simon aw, nang in bang na ci ngaisut ei? Leitung kumpite in koite tung panin sieh le kaih a dong vuoi? A tate tung pan ahi sihle midangte tung pan a dong vuoi?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Peter in, “Midangte tung pan,” a ci leh Jesu in ama kungah, “Tua ahile tate a peng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle amate i lungkhamsuo lo nadingin tuilipi-ah va pei ta’nlen tenng va khai ta’n; ang awh masa pen manin a kam phen lacin dangka peh khat na mu ding hi; tua khu la inlen nangma ading le kei adingin amate tungah pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Jesu kungah nuazuite pei-in, “Vantung gamah koi lien pen ahei?” ci-in dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in naupang khat hlanin amahaw lahah omsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A tahtah a kang ci-in, na kikhel vua naupangte tawh na kibah sih uleh vantung gam sungah na lut ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami naupangno banga a kiniemkhieh poma vantung gam sungah a lien pen hi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka min tawh tam bang naupangno khat a limbawl poma kei ei limbawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Note lahah mi khatpo in keima ei um tami naupangnote khatpo a puasah leh, a ngawng kimvelah an gawina suong golpi khat khi-in tuili thuhpi sungah tummang dawh leh ama adingin hoizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pua nading thute ziehin leitung mite a hamsie ahi uhi! Pua nading hunte ang tung valon ding a, ahi vangin puana a piengsah pa pen mi hamsie ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na khut ahi sihle na keng in ang puasah leh tansan inlen paimang in; khut kim keng kima tawntung meili sunga ang kipaih sangin khut sam keng samin hinna sunga na lut ding nang adingin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale na mit in ang puasah leh khei dawh inlen paimang in; mittang kimin hell meili sunga ang kipaih sangin mit langkhat beh tawh hinna sunga na lut ding nang adingin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tami naupangnote khatpo na simmaw khah lo nadingun kidawm un; azieh pen ke’n kang ci-in, vantunga om amau’ vantung mite in vantunga ka Pa’ maitang a mu zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen a mangthaite hundam dinga Mihing Tapa ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang na ci ngaisut vuoi? Tuucingpa khat in tuu zakhat nei hinlen tuate lahah khat gammang leh, sawmkuo le kuote muol tungah nuasie-in tua a gammang tuu sui dingin a pei sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, a mukia ciengin a gammang lo tuu sawmkuo le kuote sangin tua tuu khat ziehin a lungdamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n tami naupangnote lahah khat zong a manthai ding pen vantunga om na Pa uh’ deina ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pawlpi midang khat na tunga ang maw leh, pei inlen noma gel beh na om uh ciengin na khielna uh kigen un. Na thu ang man leh, tua mipa a ngakia na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin na thu ang man nop sih leh teci ni ahiei thum ahiei a op ciengin thu zosie thukip suoh ahi ziehin mi khat ahiei ni ahiei zawpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua pa in amate thu a man nop sih leh pawlpi tungah ko in; tuale pawlpi thu nangawn a man nop lailai sih leh Gentile mi le siehdong bangin na ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ken a mantaha kang ci-in, leitunga na hen zosie vantungah kihen ding a, leitunga na sut zosie vantungah kisut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khatvei kang cikia-in, leitungah note ni kilungtuoh a na nget popo uh vantunga om ka Pa in ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen mi ni ahi a, thum ahi zongin keima’ min suonga a kikhop uleh amate lahah keima ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter pei-in ama kungah, “ Topa aw, pawlpi midang khat ka tunga ang maw leh, bangza vei cieng ka maisah diei? Sagi vei dong cieng ka maisah diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Sagi vei cieng beh hi lo, sawm sagi mun sagi vei cieng dong maisah in kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin vantung gam pen a silate’ sum sazien a en nuom kumpipa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sazien sit a kipat ciengin a sum talent tul sawm a ba mipa khat ama kungah kipeipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in a leiba pie zo lo ahi ziehin ama-a kipan a zi a tate le a neisa zosie zua-in leiba a lo nadingin a pupa in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n a mai-ah a silapa khupdinin, ‘Ei thuoh kenkon lai in, a unpi-in kang sang na ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua silapa’ pupa in ama khuotuo ahi ziehin a leiba teng maisahin hlakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua silapa a peikhiet ciengin ama tunga denari zakhat a ba a silapite khat tawh kituoh a, tuale ama in tua pa a lawl ah manin, ‘Na leiba ei lo in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin a silapi pa zong a mai-ah bawhin thum a, ‘Ei thuoh kenkon lai in, kang lo na ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in niel hi; tua ciengin ama pei-in a leiba a lo zawh masangsie tua pa thong sungah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A silapite in tam thupieng a mu ciengun a cizalia vua, tuale amate pei-in a pupa kungah thupieng zosie a ko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua bepin a pupa in ama hlanin a kungah, ‘A gilo silapa! Kei kungah nang thum zieha na leiba zosie kang maisah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ken kang hepi ma bangin nang in zong na silapipa na hepi ding kilawm hi lo amah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuale a pupa zong lungthah a, a leiba zosie a lo zawh masangsie-in gawtna thuoh dingin ama a ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in zong na lungsim sung vuah na sanggampa ahi sihle na sanggamnu’ mawna na maisah sih uleh, vantunga om ka Pa in tua ma bangin note tungah ang bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in tam teng a gen zaw ciengin Galilee gam nuasie-in Jordan galkhatah a om Judea gamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihon tampi in ama a zui vua, tuale ama in khum tahah amate a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama a ze-et dingin a kungah Pharisee-te pawlkhat pei-in amate in, “Mi khat in thu khat popo ziehin a zi a khul ding thukham tawh a kituoh ei mah?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in, “A cil a kipan a siempa in numei le pasal a siem hi,’ a ci le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Tam thu ziehin pasal in a nu a pa nuasie-in a zi tawh kigawm ding a, ama gel sa khat a suoh ding uhi,’ ci-a kigiel na sim ngai sih uh amah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama gel pen ni hi nawn loin khat ahi ta uhi. Tua ahi ziehin Pasien in a gawmsate koima in khen sih heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Tua ahile Moses in bang dinga khulna lai pie-a zi khul nading thu ei pieh vanuh ahei,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Moses in na lungtang uh a khau seng zieha na zi khul ding uh ang phal ahi bo hi, ahi vangin a cil a kipan tam bang ahi ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note kunga kang ci-in, midang khat tawh mawna khat simlo a zi khul a, numei dang a kinunpi poma angkawm ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nuazuite in ama kungah, “Zi tungtanga pasalte tam bang ding ahi mawh leh zi nei lo ding hoizaw hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a kung vuah, “Amate tungah a kipiesate simlo mi zosie in tami thuhilna a sang zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen mi pawlkhat gesa banga suoh om a, pawlkhatte ahile midangte bawla kiget om a, pawlkhatte pen vantung gam thu ziehin amau le amau a kiget bangin a om uhi. Tam thu a sang thei tapo in sang taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a tung vuah khut nga-in thu a ngetpieh thei nadingin ama kungah naupangnote kipeipi hi. Nuazuite in amahaw a peipi mite nahpi tahin a na hosie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin Jesu in, “Tua naupangte ka kungah hing peisah un, amate kham sih un; bangzieh ahei cile vantung gam pen tua bang mite ading ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a tung vuah khut nga a, khum mun panin ama a dingdawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu kungah mi khat pei a, “Siepa aw, kumtawn hinna ka nga thei nadingin sil hoi bang ka bawl diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale ama in tuapa kungah, “Bang dinga sil hoi bang ahei ci-a nei dawh ahei? Mi hoi khat beh a om hi. Hinna sunga na lut nop leh thupiehte zui in,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Bang pen ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in, “Tuol that sin; ang kawm sin; mi na gu sin; zuou teci pang sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na nu na pa zatah in; nangma na ki-it bangin na vengte zong it in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tangvalpa in ama kungah, “Tam teng zosie ka zui siengsa hi; bang kisam lai ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Mi cingtah na hi nop leh pei-in, na neisa zosie zua inlen mizawngte tungah na sumte va pie lacin vantungah gou na nei ding hi; tua ciengin hing pei inlen ka nua ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tangvalpa in tami thu a zah ciengin ama in neisa hau mama ahi ziehin lungsisa-in a peikhie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a nuazuite kungah, “Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, mihau khat vangam a lut ding hamsa mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ke’n kang cikia-in, Pasien’ manggam sungah mihau khat a lut ding sangin hieu bilvang sungah kalaoh khat a lut ding bailam zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nuazuite in tami thu a zah uh ciengin lamdang a sa mama vua, “Tua ahi mawh leh koi ahiei hutdamna nga zo ding?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate en a, “Mihingte adingin pieng thei lo ma hi, hinanle Pasien adingin na zosie pieng thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin, “En in, kote in na zosie nuasie-in nangma kang zui uhi. Tua ahile bang ka lemlaw ding vuoi?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, na zosie a kibawltha hun, a minthanna mang topha tungah Mihing Tapa ang to hun ciengin, keima ei zui note zong kumpi topha sawm le nite tungah to-in Israel minam sawm le nite tungah thu na khen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka min zieha a inn a lo, a sanggam numei, a sanggam pasal, a nu a pa, a tate, a leitang a nuasie poma in a za zakhat nga-in kumtawn hinna a luo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin a masate nukhia ding a, a nukhiate masa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Bangzieh ahei cile vantung gam pen lengga lei-a nasem dingte ciel dinga zing tunga a kuonkhie lo nei pa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nasemte tawh a ngaina banga nitha pieh dingin a kithukim zaw ciengun a lengga lei-ah amate a kuonsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nai kuo pawlin a pei leh sumbuh lahah bangma sem lo-a a mawh din midangte a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate kungah, ‘No zong pei unlen lengga lei-ah va kuon ta un, a kilawmza khat kang pie ding hi,’ a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate zong a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sunkim pawl le nai thum pawlin pei leuleu a, tua ma bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale nai nga pawl ciengin a pusuoh leh a kimvela a ding midangte mu-in amate kungah, ‘Bang dingin sunthapai-in tam sungah bangma sem lo pi-in mawh din na hi uh ahei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a kungah, ‘Koima’n ei ciel lo zieh ahi hi,’ a ci uhi. Tuale amate kungah, ‘No zong lengga lei-ah va kuon ta un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitah ciengin lengga lei nei pa in nasem uhpa kungah, ‘Nasemte hlan inlen a kuon nukhia pen panin a kuon masa pen dongin a thaman uh hawmpieh in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nai nga pawla kicielte a pei ciengun a nitha ngaina za ciet a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kuon masate a pei ciengin a tam san deu dinga a kingaisut vangun a nitha ngaina za ciet ma a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale sum a san ciengun lo nei pa tungah a phun vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Tami a nukhiate in nai khat sung beh na sem napi, sunthapai nisa thuoha nasem kote tawh nei kibangsah hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate khat kungah, ‘Lawm aw, na tungah bangma khielna ka bawl sih hi; nitha ngaina ma thalaw dinga kithukimsa hi lo i mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma-a’ kilah inlen pei in; nangma kang piehza ma, tami a kiciel nukhiate ka pie nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka neisate ka dei bangin bawl thei lo ding ka mah? Ahi sihle ka lungsim hoi zieha thangsie na mah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nukhiate masa ding a, a masate nukhia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Jesu a peito laitahin lampi-ah nuazui sawm le nite tuom zawpi a, amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“En un, Jerusalem ah peito-in siempu makaite le thukham hil siete tungah Mihing Tapa ki-ap ding a, tuale amate in ama mawsietin sina a thuohsah ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua ciengin zako ding, sat ding le singlamte tunga khailia dingin Gentile-te tungah a ap ding uhi; tuale a ni thum ni-in ama kithosah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zebedee tapate’ nu, a tapate tawh ama kungah pei-in a mai-ah khupdinin a angvan nadingin a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale ama in tua nu kungah, “Bang dei na hei? a ci hi. Tua nu in ama kungah, “Na gam sungah tami ka tapa tegel khat na zietlamah, khat na veilamah a to nadingin thu pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in, “Na nget uh na theisiem sih uhi. Ka dawn ding hai na dawn zo ngel ding vuoi mah?” ci-in a dawh ciengin ama kungah, “Dawn zo na va ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale amate kungah, “Note in keima’ hai na dawn tahpi ding vua, ahi vangin ka zietlam le ka veilam a to ding pen kei ang pieh thei ahi sih hi, tua pen ka Pa in a bawlpiehsate ading hizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sawmte in tam thu a zah ciengun sanggam ni tegel tungah a lungthah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate hlan a, “Gam-uh Gentile-te in amate tungah a kiliensah vua, a uliente un zong thuneina tawh amate a uh lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note lahah tua bang hi lo ding hi; note lahah milien a suoh nuom poma in note’ nasem hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />note lahah a masa pen ahi nuom poma note’ sila hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihing Tapa pen midangte na semsah dinga ang pei ahi sih a, midangte’ na a sem ding le mi tampi tatkhiet nadingin a hinna pie dinga ang pei hizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in Jericho a nuasie ciengun mi tampi in a nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lampi gei-ah a to mittaw ni in tua lampi nawhin Jesu ang pei hi, ci thu a zah ciengun, “David’ Tapa, Topa aw, kote ei hepi in!” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mihonpi in a sip nadingun nahpi tahin a kham uhi; hizongle ama gel in, “David’ Tapa, Topa aw, kote ei hepi in! ci-in a kiko semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesu khawlin ama gel hlan a, “Bang hing bawlpieh leng na dei vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama gel in ama kungah, “ Topa aw, ka mit uh khuo ei musah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in ama gel a khuotuo a, a mit uh a thampieh leh thakhatin khuo mu theikia-in a nua a zui pai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem khuonai, Olive muol tunga a om Bethphage khuo a tun uh ciengin Jesu in a nuazui ni sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama gel kungah, “Na mai vua khuo ah va pei ta unlen, a no tawh khau kikhisa laapi khat thakhatin na mu ding uhi; hing sut unlen ka kungah hing kai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khatpo in bang khatpo ang gen leh, ‘ Topa in tulmaw hi,’ ci zieu locin ama in ang kaisah pailien ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam thu pen kamsangpa’ thugenna a tangtun nadinga pieng ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“En in, Zion tanu aw, na kumpipa kiniemkhiehna tawh laapi’ ta laano tungah tuongin na kung vuah ang pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuazui tegel zong Jesu’ hil bangin a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama gel in laapi le a no kai-in a tungah puonte a pha vua, tuate tungah ama a tuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihon tampite in lampi-ah a puonte uh a pha vua, adangte in singbate satin lampi-ah a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mai-a pei mihonte le a nua lama pei mihonte in, David’ Tapa tungah Hosanna! Topa’ min tawh ang pei pa in thupha nga taheh! Van a sangna munah hosanna!” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ama a lut ciengin a khuozangun a buoi gawp vua, “Tam pa koi ahei,” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipite in, “Galilee gam Nazareth khuo pana kamsang Jesu ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinnpi sungah Jesu lutin biehinnpi sunga vanzua le vanlei mi zosie notmang a, sumkhelte’ tona sabuoite le vakhu zuate’ tonate zong a khulepieh gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, ‘Ka inn in thungetna inn kici ding hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi; hizongle note in misuomte’ kibuhna kuo na suo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biehinnpi sunga ama kungah mittawte le khelbaite a pei vua, tuale ama in amate a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin siempu liente le thukham hil siete in a na lamdang bawlte mu-in, naupangte in biehinnpi sungah, “David’ Tapa tungah Hosanna,” ci-in a kikona a zah uh ciengin a lung uh thah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama kungah, “Tamte in bang thu gen ci na za ei mah?” a ci uhi. Jesu in amate kungah, “Za ma ing; note in, ‘Naungehte le nawitep nausente’ kam panin nangma ang phatna dingun na bawlpieh zo ta hi,’ ci-a kigiel khu na sim ngai sih uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate nuasie-in tua khuopi panin Bethany khuo ah ama pei a, tuanah a gieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zingmawngin khuopi lamah a kilekia ciengin ama a gil a kiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lam gei-ah theikung khat a mu ziehin a va pei taleh a nate simlo bangma a mu sih hi. Tua ciengin ama in tua theikung kungah, “Ga ngai nawn poma sin!” a ci leh tua theikung thakhatin a gawta pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nuazuite in tua khu a mu uh ciengin lamdang a sa vua, “Bangci banga theikung tuaci gawta pailien adiei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, note in um la loin upna na nei po uleh, tam theikung tunga kibawlte na bawl thei khop sih ding vua, tami muolte tung nangawn ah, ‘Kikhin inlen tuipi lilai sena’n kinei in,’ ci locin zong na ci bangun a pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note in upna tawh na nget popo uh na nga ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehinnpi sungah ama lutin thu a hil laitahin, ama kungah siempu liente le upate pei-in, “Bang thuneina tawh tamte na bawl a, tam thuneina koi ang pieh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Ke’n zong khat kang dong ding hi; note in nei dawn thei uleh ke’n zong bang thuneina tawh tam nate ka bawl ahei, ci thu kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />John’ baptize-na pen vantung pana ang pei amah, ahi sihle mihing tung pana ang kipan ahei?”ci-in a dong hi. Amate zong khatlekhat a kisel vua, “Vantung pan hi,’ ci lei lah, ‘Tua ahile bang dinga ama na muon lo uh ahei?’ ei ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin, ‘Mihing kung pan hi,’ ci zel lei lah mi zosie in John pen kamsang khata a ngaisut uh ahi ziehin mipite i giing vanuh uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Jesu kungah, “Ka thei sih uhi,” a ci uhi. Tuale ama in a kung vuah, “Ke’n zong tamte bang thuneina tawh ka bawl ahei ci kang gen tuon sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Note in bang na ci ngaisut vuoi? Mi khat in tapa ni nei hi; a tazaw pa kungah pei a, ‘Ka ta aw, tuni-in lengga lei-ah kuonin na va sem ta’n,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Kuon sih vang,’ ci napi a lungsim kikhelin a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A nauzaw pa kungah a pa pei-in tua ma bangin a va ci ta leh ama in, ‘Pa aw, va kuon ta vang,’ ci napi a kuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua nite koi zaw a pa’ deina bangin gamta ahei?” a ci hi. Amate in, “A tazaw pa in,” a ci uhi. Jesu in amate kungah, “Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, Pasien’ manggam sungah note sangin siehdongte le numei pahtatte a lut masazaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen note kungah dihna lampi tawh John ang pei napi ama na um sih vua, ahi vangin siehdongte le numei pahtatte in ama a um uhi; tua na mu zaw cieng nangawnun na lungsim uh na khel sih vua, zong na um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Thugentena dang khat na ngai un. Lengga lei a bawl lo neipa khat om a, ama in a kimvelah dai kai-in a sungah lengga cil nading dum to-in tausang khat daw hi. Tua ciengin losapte kawmsahin gam dangah a zin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anlah hun a tun ciengin ama nga ding za teng khon dingin losapte kungah a silate a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin losapte in a silate na manin khat na sat gawp vua, khat na thatin, khat suong tawh na seplia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in a sawl masahte sanga a tamzaw sila dangte sawl leuleu a, amate in a masate ma bangin na bawl veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A tawpna ah, ‘Ka tapa na zatah buong sam va uh,’ ci-in amate kungah a tapa a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin losapte in a tapa a mu ciengun, ‘Tam pa gamhluo ding pa ahi hi; hing pei un, ama that vai-in a gamh luo ding teng la vai,’ a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama manin lengga lei panin notmangin that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Lengga lei nei pa a pei ciengin tua losapte bang a law ta diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Ama in tua migilote si genthei-in sisah ding a, anlah hun cienga ama’ nga ding za a pie ding midang losapte tungah a lengga lei a kawmsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Lai Siengtho sungah: ‘Innlamte in a nilmang suong khu innkiu suongpi a suoh ta hi; tam pen ahileh Topa’ bawl ahi a, eite’ mit mu-in lamdang hi,’ a kici na sim ngai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ke’n kang ci-in, note kung panin Pasien’ manggam kiladawh ding a, a manggam gate a gasah thei minam tungah kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tami suong tunga a kie poma guoicim ding a, a tungah tami suong kie-in a denkhah popo a tepaal ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Siempu liente le Pharisee-te in a thugentena a zah ciengun amate a genna ahi lam a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate in ama mat a sawm vua, ahi vangin mipite in ama kamsang khata a ngaisut ziehun mipite a giing zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in thugentena tawh amate tungah thu genkia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vantung gam pen a tapa dinga mopawi bawl kumpipa tawh kigente thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in mopawi ankuong im dinga a kicielsate hlan dingin a silate a sawl vangin amate a pei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in sila dangte sawl leuleu a, ‘A kicielsate kungah tam bangin gen un: En un, ka nitah an min zo hi, ka bawngtangte le ka bawng thau tuituohte kigo zo a, na vannuoi a baisa-in om zo ta hi; mopawi an ne dingin hing pei ta un,’ ci-in a gensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in thudon loin pawlkhat in lo kuonsanin, adang pawlkhat in a nasepna vuah a peisan vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a omlai teng in ama’ silate manin bawlsie-in na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa zong lungthahin a galkapte sawl a, tua mithatte susie-in a khuopite uh a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a silate kungah, ‘Mopawi a baisa-in om a, a kicielte an ne dingin a kilawm nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin lamlienpi ah pei unlen mopawi an ne dingin na mu popo va ciel ta un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Silate zong lampite ah pei-in a mu zosie uh, hoi tale hoi tasih le a kaikhawm uhi; tuaci’n mopawi bawlna inn sungah pawisim mi a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ahi vangin mopawi simte van dingin kumpipa a lut ciengin khum tahah mopuon sil lo pasal khat mu kha a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama kungah, ‘Lawm aw, mopuon sil lopi-in tam sungah ang bangci lut na hei?’ a ci leh ama pa in a gen ding a thei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in a nasemte kungah, ‘A khut a keng hen unlen, kaana le hagawina mun ahi pulam khuomiel lahah paimang ta un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen mi tampi a kihlat vangin mi tawmkhat beh kiteel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharisee-te pei-in a thugenna tawh ama a mawmat thei nadingun thang a sie sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in ama kungah nuazuite le Herod mite a sawl vua, “Sie aw, nang na thutah a, thuman bangin koima zatah nei loin Pasien’ lampi na hil lam ka thei uhi; azieh pen nang in mi mai-et tuom na nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahile kumpipa tunga sieh pieh ding kilawm amah, kilawm lo ahei, ci thu na ngaisutna ei gen in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi mawh vangin Jesu in a lungsim gitlona uh thei ahi ziehin, “No mihoi kipangte aw, bang dinga nei ze-et uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sieh dinga kipie sumtang ei lah vawi uh,” a ci hi. Tuale amate in a kungah denarius khat a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah, “Tami koi’ lim le koi’ min ahiei,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in kumpipa’ lim le min ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi. Tuale amate kungah, “Kumpipa’ nate kumpipa tungah na pie unlen, Pasien’ nate Pasien tungah na pie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tami thu a zah ciengun amate in lamdang a sa vua, ama nuasie-in a peisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in ama kungah thawkiana om lo hi, a ci Sadducee-te pei-in thudawhna khat a dong vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Siepa aw, Moses in, ‘Mi khat ta nei loin a si leh, a sanggampa in tua meigongnu kinunpi-in a sanggam pa adingin ta hinpieh ding hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in ko lahah sanggam pasal sagi om hi; a ta pen pa in zi nei napi ta nei loin si a, a zi pen a sanggampa in a ensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ma bangin a ni na, a thumna-a kipanin a sagina dongin ta nei loin a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A tawpna ah tua numei zong a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahile amate in a unpi-un tua nu kinunpi kim uh ahi ziehin thawkia hun ciengin a koi pen’ zi ahi ta diei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesus in amate dawng a, “Note in Lai Siengtho thu ahi a, Pasien’ vanglietna ahi zongin thei lo na hi ziehun na ngaisun khiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen thawkia hun ciengin vantung mite ma bangin kipi kitenna om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuale misite thawkiana tawh kisai-in note kunga a gen thute na sim ngai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Keima in Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien, le Jacob’ Pasien ka hi hi,’ a ci hi. Ama a site’ Pasien ahi sih a, a hingte’ Pasien hi zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mipite in tami thu a zah ciengun ama’ thuhilna ziehin lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in Sadducee-te gen ding thei loin a sipsah lam Pharisee-te in a zah ciengun a kikaikhawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />amate lah panin thukhamsie khat in ama a ze-etna-in thu khat a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siepa aw, thukham sungah bang thupieh lienpen ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Ama in tua pa kungah, ‘Na Topa Pasien na lungtang zosie, na hinna zosie, le na lungsim zosie tawh na it ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tami pen a masapen le a lienpen thupieh a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A nina zong a masa tawh kibang hi: ‘Nangma na ki-it bangin na vengte na it ding hi,’ ci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thukham zosie le kamsangte’ thuhil zosie tami thupieh nite tunga kikhai ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pharisee-te a kikhop laitahun Jesu in amate kungah tami thu dong hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Messiah bang na ci ngaisut vuoi? Ama koi’ tapa ahiei?” a ci hi. Amate in a kungah, “David’ tapa ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Tua ahile bangci bangin David in Hlagau sawlna tawh thugenin ama Topa ci-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />‘ Topa in keima’ Topa tungah thu gen a: “Na galte na keng nei-ah ka koi masangsie-in ka zietlamah na to in,” ci hi,’ ci thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua bangin David in ama pen Topa ci ahile bangci bangin ama a tapa hi thei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Koima in dawng thei lo a, khum ni-a kipanin koima in ama bangma a dong ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in mipite le a nuazuite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Moses’ topha tungah thukham hil siete le Pharisee-te a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amau’ ang hil zosie zui-in sem un; ahi vangin a thuhil uh bangin gamta lo uh ahi ziehin amau’ gamtat bangin gamta sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in puoh zawh lo ding vangihte guongin midangte’ liengko ah a pat uhi; ahi vangin amate in lah tuate khin nadingin a khutme nangawn uh a piasah nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in a sepna zosie uh mite’ musiet dingin a sem sese uhi; azieh pen a thukham puohna uh ipte a golpipi-in bawlin a puonmongtep uzong a sau theithei-in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawi bawlna ah uliente’ tona ding munah a to nuom se vua, kikhopna inn sungah zong tona nuompen tungah a to nuom phadeu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale vanzuana munah zatahna tawh kihopi-in, mite in siepa a ci ding a dei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note na hi ule sie kici dingte na hi sih uhi, azieh pen note in sie khat na nei vua, na unpi-un sangnaupangte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vantungah Pa khat beh nei na hi ziehun leitungah koima pa ci sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in Messiah ahi sie khat nei na ahi ziehun koima in siete kicisah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note lahah a lienpen pa in note’ nasem ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau le amau a kitawisangte kiniemkhieh ding a, amau le amau a kiniemkhiehte kitawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ahi vangin no thukham hil siete le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in vantung gam sungah mite a lut thei lo nadingin kot na khah vua, noma lah lut tuon loin adang a lut nuomte lah na khahtan vanuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />No thukham hil siete, Pharisee-te, le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in meigongte’ inn na valtum vua, a kilimlawm dingin thu na sau nget giap uhi. Tua ahi ziehin note in mawsahna a golzaw na thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />No thukham hil siete, Pharisee-te, le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in mi a kikhel khat lenlon na nga nadingun tuipi le leitung kantanin na zin kawikawi vua, na ngasa uh mi kikhel thate lah note sangin a zani-in hell khuh tapa dingin na bawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Munsiengtho tawh a kiciem poma bangma a sawng sih a, hizongle munsiengtho sunga om kham tawh a kiciemte poma a kiciemna a sawng uhi,” a ci no mittaw lampuite in gimna na thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No mittawte le mimawte aw! Tua kham a thupizaw amah, ahi sihle tua kham a siengthosah munsiengtho thupizaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note in, ‘Maitam tawh a kiciem poma a sawng sih a, hizongle maitam tunga silpieh tawh a kiciem poma a kiciemna a sawng hi,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na mit uh taw sam e izaw! Azieh pen silpieh a thupizaw amah, ahi sihle tua silpieh a siengthosah maitam thupizaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n maitam tawh kiciem poma maitam le a tunga om na zosie tawh zong a kiciem ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale munsiengtho tawh a kiciem poma zong tua munsiengtho le a sunga a tengpa tawh a kiciem ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuale vantung tawh a kiciem poma Pasien’ kumpi topha le tua tunga a to mipa tawh zong a kiciem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />No thukham hil siete, Pharisee-te, le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in masala, lengmusel, le cummin sing namtuite sawm-ah-khat na pie phuat vua, thukham sunga a thupizaw ahi: thutang, khuotuona, le upnate lah na don vanuh sih uhi. Adangte nelsie tuom loin tamte na bawl zawh ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />No mittaw lampuite aw! Note in thovai seda kinei-in tui na hli vua, hizongle kala-oh na pumval vanuh uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“No thukham hil siete, Pharisee-te, le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen hai le kuongte a pulam na nawtsieng zemzom vua, hizongle a sung lamah zawthaw bawlna le huoihamna tawh kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />No mittaw Pharisee-te aw! A pulam zong a siengtho a suo thei nadingin tua hai a sunglam nawtsieng masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />No thukham hil siete, Pharisee-te, le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note na hi ule a pulamah etlawm napi, a sungah misi gute le a kidahhuoi namcin tawh a kidim hankhuh kizutngo tawh na kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n note zong midangte mai-ah na pudaang lam uh midihte na sun hiauhuau vua, hizongle na sungtawng lam uh pen a kineitawmna le gitlonate tawh kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />No thukham hil siete, Pharisee-te, le mihoi kipangte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in kamsangte’ hante na lampieh vua, mi midihte’ phawna dinga kibawl muolsuongte na zem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale note in, ‘I pu i pate khan lai-in eite a om hi leih, kamsangte’ sisan a suo amate lahah kihal talawm sam sih vai,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam bangin kamsangte a that mite’ suonlehlah na hina uh noma le noma teci pang na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na pu na pate uh’ gamtatna za na phah nadingun zomto vet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />No gulte, muoltan suonte aw! Note in hell khuh tun nading thukhenna bang na ci pel thei ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note kungah kamsangte, mipilte, le thukham hil siete kang sawl hi. Note in kimkhat thatin singlamte tungah khailia-in, kimkhatte na kikhopna uh inn sungah satin khuo khat pan khuo khatah na del kawikawi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuaci’n note tungah midih Abel’ sisan a kipanin munsiengtho sung le maitam kikala na tha uh, Barachiah’ tapa Zechariah’ sisan dongin, leitunga a kibuo midihte’ sisan teng zosie ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Keima in a tahtah a kang ci-in, tami khangte tungah tam teng zosie ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Jerusalem, Jerusalem, kamsangte thatin na kunga ang kisawl kamsangte suong tawh a seplia khuopi! Aapi in a note a hla nei-ah a huoi bangin na tate sawtveipi ka huoi nuom a, nang na nuom sih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />En in, na innpi uh a hawmin kitaisan ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azieh pen ke’n kang ci-in, ‘ Topa’ min tawh ang pei mipa in thupha nga taheh,’ na ci masangsie kei nei mukia sih ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biehinnpi panin Jesu a peikhiet laitahin tua biehinnpi’ innte ensah dingin ama kungah a nuazuite a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah, “Tam teng zosie mu hi lo uh na mah? A tahtah a kang ci-in, tam sunga suongte khat tungah adang khat a kiciengin kinuasie lo ding hi; a unpi-in kicimzansah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Olive Muol tungah Jesu a to laitahin a nuazuite in a a tuom hopi vua, “Tami thute bang cih ciengin hing pieng ding a, nang peikia nading hun le hun tawp nading limte bang hi ding ahei, ei gen in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Koima in na kipuikhiel sah lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen mi tampi in, ‘Keima Messiah ka hi hi!’ ci-in keima’ min suongin ang pei ding vua, tuale amate in mitampi a puikhiel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in gal kidonate le galdona thuthangte na za ding uhi; tamte ang pieng ding ma hi a, ahi vangin a tawpna ding hi nai lo ahi ziehin patau sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen minam khat le minam khat, gam khat le gam khat ang kido ding a, mun tuomtuomte ah kielpite tungin zil ang ling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam teng zosie pen gimna kipatna ahi na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ciengin amate in bawlsiet ding le tha dingin note ang pie ding vua, tuale keima’ min ziehin minam zosie in ang muda ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi tampite a pua ding vua, amate khatlekhat kilebawlin khatlekhat kimuda ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsang zuou tampitah ang khangin mi tampi lam a khielsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gitlona pung ding ahi ziehin mi tampite’ ki-itna kiem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin a tawp donga a thuohzo pa kihundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minam zosie tungah teci ahi dingin leitung buppi-ah tami manggam lungdamna thu kiphuongzah ding hi; tua zaw ciengin tawpna ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuaci’n kamsang Daniel in a gen bangin a siengtho mun sungah a susie thei kidahhuoina ang din na mu uh ciengin (laisimte in thei ta uheh),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua ciengin Judea gama omte muolte tungah tai uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />innkhum tunga omte inn sunga van la dingin kumsuh sih heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />lo lai-a om mipa zong a puon la dingin peikia sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin numei gaite le nausen neite mi hamsie ahi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na galtai ding hun uh pen phalbi le sabbath ni ahi lo nadingin thu ngen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen leitung piencil a kipanin tuni cieng dong a pieng ngai nai lo, nidang cienga zong a pieng ngai nawn lo ding gimna lienpi tua hun ciengin ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua nite a kitomsah sih leh koima a suohta sih ding hi; ahi vangin a teelsate adingin tua nite kitomsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi khatpo in na kung vuah, ‘En un! Tanah Messiah om! ahi sihle, ‘Ama khunah om! ang ci uleh um sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile messiah zuoute le kamsang zuoute ang pieng ding a, ahi thei leh a tatsate nangawn lampielsah dingin lim le na lamdang lienpite ang bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ciemte in, kang gen masah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in na kung vuah, ‘En un! Gamlahah a om hi,’ ang ci uleh va pei ta sih un. Amate in, ‘En un! Innkhan sungah ama om hi,’ ang ci uleh zong tahsang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tunphe in nisuona panin nitumna dong a tansah bangin, Mihing Tapa ang pei ding zong tua bang ma hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siluong opna popo-ah langtate a kikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tua gimna nite zaw ciengin thakhatthu-in ni kimielsah ding a, hlapi zong tang nawn lo ding hi; van panin aasite kiesuh ding a, vana om vanglietnate kiling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantungah Mihing Tapa’ lim ang kilang ding hi; tua ciengin leitung minam zosie kap ding a, amate in vanglietna le minthanna lienpi tawh vana meiilumte tungah tuonga ang pei Mihing Tapa a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in a gin ngaih mama pengkul mutna tawh a vantung mite ang sawl ding a, van mong khat pan mong khat dong, lei kiu li panin a teelsa mite a kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Theikung panin thusinna nei un: Theikung a bate hing mengin a na ang dawn ciengin khuokhal hun nai ta hi, ci-in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ma bangin tam thute zosie na mu ciengun kotbieng dongin ama ang nai ta hi, ci-in thei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, tam thute zosie ang tun sieng masangin tam khang mite a si sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Van le lei maimang ding a, hizongle ka thute maimang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Ahi vangin a ni le a hun koima in thei lo hi, vantunga om vantung mite in ahi a, Tapa in ahi zongin thei lo a, Pa khat beh in thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Mihing Tapa ang peikia ding hun pen Noah hun lai ma tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azieh pen tuizin a tun masanga kipan tembaw sungah Noah a lut dongin mite in an ne tui dawnin numei pasal kipi kitengin a om vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuale tuizin tungin a unpi-un a lahmang hun dongin bangma thei loin a op ma bangun, Mihing Tapa ang pei ciengin zong tua bang ma hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ciengin lo lai-a om mi ni; khat kila-in khat kinuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An neh suton numei ni; khat kila-in khat kinuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na Topa uh ang pei ni ding thei lo na hi ziehun kigalging un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam thu thei un: Inn neipa in zan lai-in guta pa pei ding hun theikhol leh na kigalging ding a, a inn lusah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na upmaw lo laitahun Mihing Tapa ang pei ding ahi ziehin note zong a kigingsa-in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Tua ahile a pupa in ama’ innkuon sunga vaihawm ding le a hunhuna nasem dangte nga ding za ciet an pie dinga a koi a muonhuoi le a pil silapa koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A pupa ang tun ciengin tua bangin nasemin a om sila a mu pa pen mi hampha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, a pupa in ama’ neisa zosie tungah a vaihawm dingin tua pa a koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua sila gilopa in a lungsim sungah, ‘Ka pupa hing kiheh lel va,’ ci-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />a seppi silate satgawp hinlen, zukhamte tawh an ne zu dawnin na om leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />a upmaw lo kal le a thei lo kalin tua silapa’ pupa ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama in tua silapa semnenin mihoi kipangte tawh kaana le hagawina munah a koiton ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua ciengin vantung gam pen zinei pa dawn dingin meivah keng a, a kuonkhie mopawi sim ngahnu sawmte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate lahah mi nga maw-in mi nga pil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua a mawte in a meivah uh keng napi meitui a keng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pilte in ahileh meitui kithalsa thawlte a keng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zinei pa a kiheh ziehin a unpi-un lusu-in a kimu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin zankim ciengin, ‘En un! Zinei pa tanah hing tung ta! Ama dawn dingin hing pei un,’ ci-in kitangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin mopawi sim ngahnu sawmte tho-in a meivah uh a puo ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mawte in a pilte kungah, ‘Ka meivah uh a mit ding hi ta, na meitui uh themkhat ei hawm un,’ ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pilte in, ‘Hi thei sih! No ading le ko ading kicing sih va; pei unlen meitui zuate kungah noma ading lei zaw un,’ ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in meitui a lei laitahun zinei pa tungin a kigingsa teng tawh mopawi ah a lut ton uhi; tuale kot a kikha pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin adang mopawi sim ngahnute zong tungin, ‘ Topa , Topa aw, kot ei hon in,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, ‘A tahtaha kang ci-in, note kang thei kha sih hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a ni a nai thei lo na hi ziehun ngah lenlon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tami pen a nasemte hlanin a neisa teng amate a ap zaw ciengin khuol zin mi khat tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau’ siemna tawh kizui-in khat tungah talent nga, adang khat tungah ni, adang khat tungah khat ci bangin a pie ciet hi. Tua ciengin ama a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Talent nga a nga pa pei-in tua teng tawh sum bawl a, adang talent nga a mu be hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ma bangin talent ni a nga pa in talent ni ma a mube hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin talent khat a nga pa pei-in leisung to-in a pu’ sum a phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun sawtpi zaw ciengin silate’ pu pei-in amate tawh sum sazien laibu a en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin talent nga a nga pa in a mube talent nga tawi-in a mai-ah pei a, ‘Pu aw, kei tungah talent nga nei ap hi; en in, talent nga ka na mube hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pu in ama kungah, ‘Hoi sep cie, a hoi le a muonhuoi silapa; sil themno khat tungah na muonhuoi hi, a tampi tungah zong vaihawmin kang koi ding hi; na pu tawh nuomsa ton in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Talent ni a nga pa zong a mai-ah pei-in, ‘Pu aw, kei tungah talent ni nei ap hi; en in, talent ni ka na mube hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pu in ama kungah, ‘Hoi sep cie, a hoi le a muonhuoi silapa; sil themno khat tungah na muonhuoi hi, a tampi tungah zong vaihawmin kang koi ding hi; na pu tawh nuomsa ton in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin talent khat a nga pa a mai-ah pei-in, ‘Pu aw, nang mi genha pi khat na hi hi, na vaw lona munah khaici na at a, na the lona munah a ga na khop lam ka thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuaci’n kei ka zau a, tuale pei-in lei sungah ka talent ka phuol hi. Tanah nang-a’ teng ma a om hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pu in, ‘Nang migilo mi thada silapa! Ka vaw lona munah atin ka the lona munah ka khop lam na thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sumkholna ah ka sumte na koi lacin hoi ngel ding hiven, tua hile kang kilekia ciengin ka sum a met tawh ka nga theikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahile ama kung panin tua talent la unlen, talent sawm nei mipa pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a nei poma kipiehbe ding a, amate in tampi neibe ding uhi; ahi vangin bangma a nei lote kung panin a neisun nangawn uh kilahpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kaana le hagawina mun a pulam khuomiel lahah bangma-a kimang lo tami silapa pai dawh ta un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa in ama’ minthanna silin vantung mite zosie tawh ang pei ciengin a minthanna kumpi topha tungah ang to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama mai-ah minam zosie kikhawm ding a, tuucing pa in tuu le keel a tuom khen ma bangin ama in mite a tuomin khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in tuute a zietlamah koi-in, keelte a veilamah koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in a zietlam a omte kungah, ‘Ka pa in thupha a piehsa mite aw, hing pei unlen, leitung kisiemcil a kipanin note dinga a kibawlsa gam luo un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ka gilkiel laitahin ka neh ding an nei pie vua, ka dangta laitahin ka dawn ding tui nei pie uhi. Khuolmi ka hi laitahin zin nei do vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />sil ding puon ka nei lo laitahin puon nei pie uhi. Ka cinat laitahin nei kem vua, thong sunga ka op laitahin nei ve uhi,’ a ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin midihte in, ‘ Topa aw, bang cihin na gilkiel hing mu-in an kang pie vua, bang cihin na dangta hing mu-in tui kang pie ngai uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bang cihin khuolmi na hi lam hing mu-in zin kang do vua, bang cihin na puon nei lo lam hing mu-in puon hing pie ka hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bang cihin na cinat hing mu-in kang kem ta vua, bang cihin na thongkieh lam hing mu-in kang ve ta uh ahei,’ ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate kungah, ‘A tahtaha kang ci-in, tami ka innkuonpite lahah a neupen khat tunga na bawlte uh kei tunga a bawl na hi uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a veilam a omte kungah, ‘No samsiet mite aw, dawimangpa le a vantung mite dinga kibawlsa tawntung meikuong sungah pei ta un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />azieh pen ka gilkiel laitahin an nei pie sih vua, ka dangta laitahin tui nei pie sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khuolmi ka hi laitahin zin nei do sih vua, puon ka nei lo laitahin puon nei pie sih uhi. Ka cinat laitahin nei kem sih vua, ka thong kieh laitahin nei ve sih uhi,’ a ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in zong, ‘ Topa aw, bang cihin gilkielin na dangta a, zin tungin puon nei loin na op lam le, cina-in thong sunga na op lam hing mu-in hing kem lo uh ka hei?’ ci-in a dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, ‘A tahtaha kang ci-in, tam mite a neupen khat tunga na bawlte uh kei tunga a bawl na hi uhi,’ ci-in amate a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate kumtawn gawtna munah a pei ding vua, midihte ahile kumtawn hinna sungah a lut ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in tami thu teng zosie a gen zaw ciengin a nuazuite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuzaw ni ni ciengin Peisan Pawi ang tung ding a, singlamte tungah khailia dingin Mihing Tapa kipie ding hi, ci na thei uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Caiaphas a kici siempu lienpen pa’ innpi ah siempu lien pa le mipi upate a kikhawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale amate in Jesu guh matin tha ding a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in, “Mipite lahah buoina ang om kha thei ding ahi ziehin pawi sungin bawl sih vai,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethany khuo-a miphah Simon inn ah Jesu a op laitahin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a manpha mama alabaster sathau namtui thawl khat tawi-in numei khat ama kungah pei a, sabuoi tungah a to laitahin tua sathau namtui a lu tungah a sungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin nuazuite in a mu ciengun a lung uh thah a, “Bang dinga tam sathau a hici mawh zah adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen tami sathau kizua leh sum tampi tah kikhawng ding a, tua sum teng mizawngte hawmpieh zaw velei” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in tami thu thei ahi ziehin amate kungah, “Bang dinga tami numei nu na suhbuoi uh ahei? Ama nu in kei tungah sil hoi khat sem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen note tawh mizawngte ang om zing ding ahi a, ahi vangin note tawh kei kang om zing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pum tunga tami sathau ei buohna pen ka kivui cienga a bawldan ding a mazil ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, leitung buppi-ah tami lungdamna thu a kigenna muncin tengah tami nu phawna-in a silbawlte kigengen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu liente kungah sawm le nite lahah khat ahi Judah Iscariot a kici mipa pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ke’n ama hing lebawlin no kungah hing pie leng bang nei pie ding vuoi?” a ci hi. Amate in dangka sawmthum ama a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum hun a kipanin ama a lebawl thei nadingin hun lemtang sui a kipan pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tolsawlo Anlum Pawi ni masa pen ni-in Jesu kungah nuazuite a pei vua, “Peisan Pawi ankuong lui nading hei sungah nang bawlpieh uleng na nuom ei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Khuopi sunga mi khat kungah pei unlen ama kungah, ‘Siepa in ka hun hing nai ta, na inn ah ka nuazuite tawh Peisan Pawi kang bawl ding hi, ci hi,’ va ci ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu’ gen bangin nuazuite a gamta vua, Peisan Pawi an ding a siem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nitah ciengin ama in sawm le nite tawh ankuong a imton hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale an a neh laitahun ama in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, note lahah khat in kei ei leheh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale amate a da mama vua, ama kungah a banbanin, “ Topa , kei hi sam sih vang izaw?” a ci ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in, “Keima tawh kuong sunga a khut tawh a sawhpa in ei leheh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama tungtang thu a kigielsa ma bangin Mihing Tapa pen a pei ding ma hi a, hizongle Mihing Tapa a leheh pa in gimna a thuoh ding hi! Tua mipa ang pieng vet lo hi leh ama adingin hoizaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama a leheh Judah in, “Siepa kei ka hi amah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Na ci bang ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in an a neh laitahun Jesu in khomun lum khat la-in phalsuo-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin nuazuite pie a, “La unlen ne un; tam pen ka pumpi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in hai zong la-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin amate pie a, “Na unpi-un dawn un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />azieh pen tami in mi tampi’ mawna a kimaisah nadinga a kibuokhie thuciemna tawh kisai ka sisan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, ka Pa’ gam sungah note tawh lenggazu tha ka dawn masangin tam lenggazu ka dawn ngai nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in phatna la a sah zaw uh ciengin Olive Muol tungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Note in tu zanin keima ziehin na unpi-un nei taisan ding uhi. Azieh pen, ‘Tuucingpa ka satlia ding a, tuuhonte a kithethang ding hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin ei kithawsah zaw ciengin no masangah Galilee gam ka na pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Peter in ama kungah, “Nangma ziehin mi zosie taimang sieng nanle ke’n nang kang taisan ngai vawt sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, tu zan mama aah a khuon masangin thumvei tah nei niel ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Peter in ama kungah, “Nangma tawh siton nading hinanle nang kang niel sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Nuazui zosiete in zong tua ma bangin a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu a nuazuite tawh Gethsemane a kici munah a pei hi; tuale ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Khunah pei-in thu ka nget kalin tanah na to un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in Peter le Zebedee’ tapa ni zawpi a, da le lungkham hun ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kung vuah, “Si nading za dong nangawnin ka lung a kham hi; tanah na om unlen ei na ngah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuale bakhat pei lai-in tuolah kiphengpha a, “Ka Pa aw, a pien thei ding leh tami hai tawh ei kipelsah ta’n; ahi vangin kei deina bang hi sih hinlen nangma’ deina bang hizaw heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nuazuite kungah a pei leh amate kimu-a om a mu hi; tuale ama in Peter kungah, “Nai khat sung nangawn ei ngah zo lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gimna hun sungah na lut lo nadingun ngahin thungen un; lungsim a lawp vangin tahsa thanem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A niveina va peikia-in thu ngen a, “Ka Pa aw, tami hai kei dawn lo-a phamaw ahi vawt leh lah nangma’ deina bang hi taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama khatvei a peikia leh a mit uh hah zo nawn lo ahi ziehin amate a kimusa ma-in a mu leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate nuasie kia-in a nget ngai teng ma a thumveina a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin nuazuite kungah ama pei-in a kung vuah, “Kimu-in a khawl hit hiet lai na hi uh amah? En un, Mihing Tapa kilehehin mawnei mite’ khut sungah a kipieh ding hun ang nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tho un, pei vai. En un, kei ei leheh ding pa ang nai ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in thu a gen kim laitahin sawm le nite sung panin Judas a tung hi; siempu liente le mipi upate’ sawl ahi namsau le phohbul a tawi mihonpi tawh ama zawhton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuale a leheh pa in amate kungah lim khat pie a, “Kang nap ding pa khu tua pa ahi hi; ama man pai un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Thakhatin Jesu kungah pei a, “Na dam ei, Siepa!” ci-in ama a nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Lawm aw, tana na sep ding teng sem meng in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin amate pei-in Jesu tungah a khut utawh tu-in a man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesu tawh a omton mite lahah khat in thakhatin a khut tawh a namsau zamin dawh a, siempu lien pa’ silapa a sat leh a bil a bansan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Na namsau a pai-ah sietkia in; azieh pen namsau tawite namsau ma tawh si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ka pa kungah a ngen thei lo nei sa uh amah? A ngen hi leng keima kungah vantung mite legion sawm le ni val, thakhatin ang sawl zieu ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua bang hi mawh leh Lai Siengtho in tu-a banga a pien nading a gen pen bangci tangtun thei ta ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Khum hunin Jesu in mipite kungah, “Guta bulu khat mat banga kei ei man dinga namsau le phohbul tawh hing kuon na hi uh amah? Nisimin biehinnpi sungah to-in thu ka hil laitahin lah nei man zel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hinanle kamsangte’ Lai Siengtho a tangtun nadinga tam bang teng zosie ang pieng ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin nuazuite zosie in ama nuasie-in a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Jesu a mante in thukham hil siete le upate kikhopna inn, siempu lien pa Caiaphas kungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Peter in siempu lien pa’ inntuol dong a gamla seng lo panin ama a zui hi; ama in a thu tawpna a thei nadingin a sungah lutin a cingte tawh a toton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Siempu liente le vaihawmte in Jesu a tha thei nadingun ama langkhatah zuou teci a sui vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />zuou teci tampi tah a mai-ah a pei vangun amate in a mawna a mu sih uhi. A tawpna ah mi ni a mai-ah a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“Tam mipa in, ‘Pasien’ biehinnpi ka susie zo ding a, ni thum sungin ka lamkia ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Siempu lien pa dingin, “Dawn nading na nei sih amah” Na lang khatah a tecipanna uh bang teng ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu ham loin a om hi. Tua ciengin siempu lien pa in ama kungah, “A hingzing Pasien’ mai-ah kang ciemsah hi, Pasien Tapa Messiah na mah, ei gen in” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Jesu in tua pa kungah, “Na cisa ma bang ahi hi. Ahi vangin ke’n kang ci-in, Tu-a kipanin vanglietna zietlamah Mihing Tapa to-in, vana meiilum tung tuongin ang pei na mu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa in a puonsilte balkehin, “Pasien tungah a hamkhiel ta hi! Teci dang a kisam nawn amah? En un, tu-in a hamkhielna na za zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na thukhenna uh bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Amate in, “A si dingin kilawm hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in a maitang cil phi-in a vuo uhi; tuale kimkhatte in a phebeh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Nang Messiah aw, ei gen vawi, nang ang vuo koi ahiei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tua laitahin inntuol ah Peter a na to hi. Numei nasem khat ama kungah pei a, “Nang zong Galilee mi Jesu tawh kipawl ngel vete aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “Na thugen theikha vawt sing,” ci-in amate zosie mai-ah kilepin a niel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Innhlap lam zuonin a pusuo ciengin adang numei nasem khat ma in mu a, a gei-a dingte kungah, “Tam pa Nazareth mi Jesu tawh kipawl ngai ngel ve aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua pa thei ngai vawt sing!” ci-in kitomlaw-in a nielkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tua zaw a sawt loin a gei-a dingte pei-in Peter kungah, “Nang zong amate lahah khat hi lenlon teh, na awsuo-in zong ang kithei ngengngong khu,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama le ama kisamsie-in, “Tua pa thei kha kilkel sing!” ci-in a kitomlaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in, “Aa a khuon masangin thumvei nei niel ding hi,” ci-a Jesu thugen a phawhkia hi. Tuale ama pusuohin nahpi tahin a kap hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin siempu liente zosie le mipi upate pei-in Jesu thalup thei nading thu a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in lep-ia sa-in a zawpi vua, gam uhpa Pilat khut sungah a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama a leheh pa Judas in Jesu a kimawsah a thei ciengin kisiakia-in siempute le upate kungah dangka sawmthum a piekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in, “Maw nei lo sisan ka lebawl ziehin ka khiel zo hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin amate in, “Tuami ko tawh bang kisai ahei? Na law theithei kilaw ta’n,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a sum teng biehinnpi sungah sepsuhin a peisan hi; tuale ama pei-in ama le ama a gui-awh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin siempu liente in tua dangkate a la vua, “Tamte sisan man ahi ziehin biehinn sumkholna-a koi dingin kilawm lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a kikup zaw ciengun tua sum teng gamdang mite vui nadingin beelkheng pa’ lo a lei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tua mun pen tuni dongin Sisan Leitang kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsang Jeremiah tungtawnin, “Israel mite pawlkhat in ama’ man dinga a sesa uh tua dangka sawmthum a la vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in kei ei thupieh bangin beelkheng pa’ lo lei nadingin a pie uhi,” ci-a kigensa thu a tangtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in gam uhpa mai-ah Jesu a ding hi; tuale gam uhpa in, “Nang Juda kumpi na hi amah?” ci-in a dong hi. Jesu in, “Na ci bangin ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin siempu liente le upate in a mawmat uh ciengin ama in dawng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in ama kungah, “Amate in nang lang khatah ang mawmatna uh tampite za lo na hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a kimawsahna khat beh nangawn zong a dawnkia lo ziehin gam uhpa in lamdang sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hun lai-in pawi a kibawl ciengin gam uhpa in mihonpite’ dei thongkie mi khat popo a hla zel ngaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum hunin amate in Jesu Barabbas a kici a gilo-a minthang thongkie khat a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n a kikhop zaw ciengun Pilat in amate kungah, “Jesu Barabbas le Messiah kici Jesu koizaw ka hla ding na dei vuoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in hazatna tawh ama tungah a ap uh ahi lamtah a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thukhenna topha tungah a to laitahin a zinu in ama kungah kam vaihlah a, “Tuzan ka mangah ama ziehin nahpi tahin gimna thuoh ka hi ziehin mawna nei lo tua mipa bangma na law sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Barabbas hla-in Jesu tha dinga a nget nadingun siempu liente le upate in mihonpite a zawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gam uhpa in amate kungah, “Koi zaw ka hla ding na dei vuoi?” ci-in a dongkia hi. Tuale amate in, “Barabbas” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilat in amate kungah, “Tua ahile Messiah a kici Jesu bang ka law diei?” a ci hi. Amate in a unpi-un, “Singlamte tungah khailumsah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Bang ziehin lah, ama in bang sietna bawl ahei?” ci-in a dong hi. Hinanle amate in, “Singlamte tung ah ama khailumsah in!” ci-in a awng semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pilat in bangma a law thei ta sih a, buoina kipatna hizaw bep va ci a thei ciengin, ama in tui themkhat la-in mipite mai-ah a khut silsieng a, “Tam mipa’ sisan tungah ka sieng hi; na law theithei kilaw ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin mipi zosie in, “Ama’ sisan kote tung le ka suonlehlahte uh tungah tu taheh!” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in amate adingin Barabbas a hlakhie hi; Jesu ahile a sat zaw ciengin singlamte tunga khailup dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin gam uhpa’ galkapte phuolpi ah Jesu a peipi vua, a kimvelah galkap honpi zosie a kikhawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in a puonsilte hawhkhiet piehin ama tungah puontuol dupsan khat a silsah vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuale amate in ling tawh kibawl kumpi lukhu khat phanin ama’ lu tungah a khusah uhi. Amate in a zietlamah pumpeng khat tawisahin a mai-ah a khupdin vua, “Judah Kumpipa aw, na khan sawt taheh!” ci-in a zako uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama a cilphit vua, tuale a pumpeng la-in a lutang a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama a zako zaw ciengun a puontuol hawhkhieh piehin a puonte ma a silsahkia uhi. Tua ciengin amate in khailup dingin ama a zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate a pei laitahun Simon kici Cyrene pana mi khat tawh a kituoh kha uhi; amate in ama’ singlamte puo dingin tua pa a pausawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuale Golgotha (Lugu Mun a ci nopna) kici munah a tun ciengun amate in a dawn dingin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tuikha kihal lenggazu a pie uhi; hizongle ama in ciem a, a dawn nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Singlamte tungah Jesu a khailia zaw ciengun amate in aisanna tawh a puonte a hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin khumnah amate to-in ama a en uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in Jesu’ lu tung son tahah, “Tam pa pen Judah Kumpipa Jesu ahi hi,” ci-a kigiel mawmatna lai a suong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tawh misuomte ni, khat a zietlamah, khat a veilamah kikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua mun a nawhkha mite in a lu uh vihin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Biehinnpi susie-in ni thum sunga a lamkia ding pa aw, nang le nang kihunkhie vawi! Pasien’ tapa na hi leh singlamte tung panin hing kumsuh in,” ci-in a elho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ma bangin siempu liente in zong thukham hil siete le upate tawh ama a zako vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Ama in midangte hunkhie thei napi ama le ama lah a kihunkhie thei vanuh sih hi; ama Israel-te’ Kumpipa ahi hi; tu-in a singlamte tung panin hing kumsuh leh i um pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in Pasien muong hi; tu-in Pasien in pha a sah leh ama hunkhie taheh; azieh pen ama in, “Kei Pasien’ tapa ka hi hi,’ ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama tawh a kikhaiton misuomte in zong tua bang ma-in a tawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sunkim a kipanin nitah nai thum dongin tua gam sung zosie-ah mutzin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nai thum hun pawlin Jesu in, “Eli, Eli, lema sabachthani?” ci-in nahpi tahin kiko a, tua pen ka Pasien, ka Pasien, bang zieha nei nuasie ahei?” a cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A gei-a ding pawlkhat in a zah ciengun amate in, “Tam mipa in Elijah hlan hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amate lahah khat tai pai a, tui hupna khat la-in lenggazu thua sungah die a, cieng dawnah koi-in a dawn dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahi vangin adangte in, “Ngah phot un, ama a hunkhie dingin Elijah ang pei ei mah en tadi vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu nahpi tahin kikokia-in a naahu tawpin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin biehinnpi kidatna puonkhai a tung panin a nei dongin phalni kisuo hi. Zil zong lingin suongtumpite a pawhkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hankhuhte kihong a, a sisa mi siengthote’ luonghawm kithosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ama a thawkia zo ciengin hankhuh panin amate a pusuoh vua, khuopi siengtho sungah lutin mi tampite tungah a kihil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jesu a cing galkapmangpa le a ompite in zil kiling le tua thupiengte a mu ciengun a zausi vua, “Tampa, Pasien’ tapa lah ahi tahpi mawh in!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Khum munah gamlapi pana a gal et numei tampitah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuate lahah Mary Magdalene, James le Joseph’ nu Mary, le Zebedee’ tapa tegel’ nu zong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nitah ciengin Arimathea khuo panin Jesu’ nuazui zong ahi Joseph a kici mihaupa khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Pilat kungah pei-in Jesu’ luong ngen hi; tua ciengin Pilat in zong ama tunga pieh dingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tuaci’n a luong la-in dielpuon siengtho khat tawh a tun zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />suong a tawkuohsa ama’ hantha sungah a siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mary Magdala le adang Mary zong hankhuh maingatin a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A zing cieng, Kiginni zaw ciengin Pilat mai-ah siempu liente le Pharisee-te a kikhawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />“Siepa aw, tua mi solpa in a hin lai-in, ‘Ni thum zaw ciengin ka thokia ding hi,’ a ci thu ka ciemte lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ni thum a cin masangsie han hoi taha a kicin nadingin thu pie in; tua bang ahi sihle a nuazuite na pei-in a luonghawm na gu-in mipite kungah, “Ama sina pan tho zo ta hi,’ ci-in gen thei kha mawh ding uhi. Tua hileh a mi sol masahna uh pen a misol nukhia uh sangin ang siehuoizaw lai kha ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilat in amate kungah, “A cing ding galkap na nei uhi; pei unlen, na hi thei za-un a muonhuoi thei pen dingin bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate pei-in hankhuh sinna suong seal tumin a ciemte zaw ciengun a cing ding galkapte koi-in muonhuoi tahin hankhuh a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath ni zaw, nipi kal khat sunga ni masa pen ni, phalvah hunin Mary Magdalene le adang Mary-te han vil dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale thakhatthu-in zil nahpi-in a kiling hi; bangzieh ahei cile vantung panin Topa’ vantungmi khat kumsuh a, hankhuh suongpi liamang dawhin a tungah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ mel pen tunphe tawh kibang a, a puonte vua bangin a ngo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Han cingte in ama a giin ziehun citunin a sibup uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua vantungmi in numeite kungah, “Zau sih un; singlamte tunga kikhai Jesu a sui na hi lam uh ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam tahah ama om nawn lo hi; azieh pen a gensa bangin ama tho zo hi. Hing pei unlen ama a kisielna mun hing en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin mallang tahin pei unlen a nuazuite kungah, ‘Misite lah panin ama thokia zo a, Galilee gama na masang vuah a pei tahpi ding hi; tua munah ama na mu ding uhi,’ ci-in va gen ta un. Note dinga kang thupuoh tami ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in zau le thanuom kawmin thakhatin han nuasie-in a nuazuite kungah a gen dingin a tai pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu in thakhatin amate na lamdot a, “Na dam vuoi mah!”a ci hi. Tuale amate a kungah a pei vua, a keng kawipomin a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Zau sih un; pei unlen Galilee-a haw dingin ka sanggamte kungah va gen ta un; amate in khum munah kei ei mu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate a pei laitahin khuopi sungah hancingte pawlkhat a pei vua, siempu liente kungah a thupieng zosie a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siempu liente le upate a kisuhtuo zaw uh ciengin, galkapte sum tampi pieh dingin gelna khat a nei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Amate kungah, ‘Zanlai ka kimut laitahun a nuazuite hing pei-in a luong a gudap ta uhi,’ ci-in gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gam uhpa in tam thu a za khah tah leh zong ama ka lungkimsah ding vua, no kang buoisah sih ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a sumte a sang vua, tuale a kisawl bangin amate a gamta uhi. Tami tangthu pen Judah mite lahah tuni dongin kigen lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin nuazui sawm le khatte zong, Jesu in amate kunga a gensa bangin Galilee gam muol tungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in ama a mu ciengun a bie uhi; ahi vangin pawlkhat a tahsang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale Jesu pei-in amate kungah, “Vantung le leitunga thuneina zosie kei tungah ei kipie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note pei-in minam zosie ka nuazui suohsah unlen, Pa, Tapa, le Hlagau Siengtho’ min tawh na baptize un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin kang thupieh zosie a zui nadingun amate na hil un. Tuale hun tawp dongin keima in note kang ompi zing ding ahi lam phawh un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
